Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.16,0:00:24.87,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我发现了一颗闪着金色光芒\N不可思议的彗星
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.58,0:00:27.16,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,运行的轨道非常乱
Dialogue: 0,0:00:27.54,0:00:29.33,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,它只要发现行星就会立刻靠近
Dialogue: 0,0:00:29.33,0:00:30.70,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,像木星 火星 地球和金星
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.70,0:00:32.16,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,它只要发现行星就会立刻靠近
Dialogue: 0,0:00:32.33,0:00:34.33,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,就像活的生物一样
Dialogue: 0,0:00:34.54,0:00:36.54,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,唔? 呵呵...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:36.83,0:00:38.58,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哪有这种彗星
Dialogue: 0,0:00:38.75,0:00:40.75,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是真的 你看看
Dialogue: 0,0:00:41.41,0:00:43.83,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,已经不见了
Dialogue: 0,0:00:43.83,0:00:44.00,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,呵呵...你一定是看错了吧
Dialogue: 0,0:00:44.00,0:00:46.50,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,呵呵...你一定是看错了吧
Dialogue: 0,0:00:57.83,0:01:02.58,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,啊...小木马 不能在这里奔驰
Dialogue: 0,0:01:02.83,0:01:04.00,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这里很窄的
Dialogue: 0,0:01:04.33,0:01:06.20,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,万一被人发现怎么办?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:06.83,0:01:09.50,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,今天的散步就到此为止 回去睡觉
Dialogue: 0,0:01:10.25,0:01:13.04,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,如果有个宽阔的牧场 那该有多好
Dialogue: 0,0:01:22.41,0:01:25.00,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这是个辽阔无边的牧场
Dialogue: 0,0:01:25.50,0:01:27.37,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我和我的爱马史达龙
Dialogue: 0,0:01:27.50,0:01:29.75,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,爬上了小山丘上
Dialogue: 0,0:01:29.87,0:01:31.37,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,看着火红的夕阳
Dialogue: 0,0:01:31.50,0:01:35.50,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,从地平线的那一端慢慢西沉
Dialogue: 0,0:01:35.66,0:01:38.75,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,呵...这件事你到底要说几次呀
Dialogue: 0,0:01:39.37,0:01:41.58,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好事当然要多说几次呀
Dialogue: 0,0:01:42.00,0:01:45.37,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 现在边在说马...\N- 那么大雄你有马吗?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:45.66,0:01:46.83,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,嗯
Dialogue: 0,0:01:47.00,0:01:49.66,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那你有牧场吗?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:50.00,0:01:52.00,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,当然有了
Dialogue: 0,0:01:52.20,0:01:53.87,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是真的吗? 大雄
Dialogue: 0,0:01:54.08,0:01:55.16,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,真的吗 大雄
Dialogue: 0,0:01:55.41,0:01:56.83,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,当然是真的
Dialogue: 0,0:01:57.20,0:01:59.08,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那你现在就带我们\N去参观你的牧场
Dialogue: 0,0:01:59.58,0:02:01.83,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,现在不行 那就就今天晚上吧
Dialogue: 0,0:02:03.66,0:02:05.58,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,今晚大家都要去看哦
Dialogue: 0,0:02:06.41,0:02:07.83,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,一定哦
Dialogue: 0,0:02:08.66,0:02:10.83,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,小叮当...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:11.16,0:02:13.58,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你又吹那种无聊的牛皮了吧?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:14.25,0:02:18.37,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我才没有吹牛皮\N是因为阿福太骄傲 所以...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:18.58,0:02:19.58,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你太多事了
Dialogue: 0,0:02:20.33,0:02:23.16,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,求求你\N在今晚之前帮我建一个牧场
Dialogue: 0,0:02:23.50,0:02:24.54,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不行
Dialogue: 0,0:02:24.87,0:02:26.20,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,拜托帮帮忙吧
Dialogue: 0,0:02:26.50,0:02:28.04,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,绝对不行
Dialogue: 0,0:02:28.66,0:02:32.08,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,地球上没有多余的土地了
Dialogue: 0,0:02:32.50,0:02:33.50,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,拜托你啦
Dialogue: 0,0:02:33.83,0:02:34.66,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不行
Dialogue: 0,0:02:34.83,0:02:35.58,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,拜托你
Dialogue: 0,0:02:35.75,0:02:38.20,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我等一下还有事要办
Dialogue: 0,0:02:38.66,0:02:42.33,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我要到22世纪的大拍卖\N买一些东西
Dialogue: 0,0:02:42.50,0:02:45.87,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,小叮当...小叮当...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:00.37,0:03:02.54,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,小叮当剧场版\N发条都市冒险记
Dialogue: 0,0:03:02.70,0:03:04.60,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这种事情真好\Nこんなこといいな
Dialogue: 0,0:03:04.70,0:03:06.54,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,可以完成更好\Nできたらいいな
Dialogue: 0,0:03:06.70,0:03:08.60,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,有那样的　有这样的\Nあんなゆめ　こんなゆめ
Dialogue: 0,0:03:08.60,0:03:11.54,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,有各式各样的梦想\Nいっぱいあるけど
Dialogue: 0,0:03:12.33,0:03:14.20,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大家　大家　大家啊\Nみんな　みんな　みんな
Dialogue: 0,0:03:14.20,0:03:16.60,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,来帮我实现愿望啊\Nかなえてくれる
Dialogue: 0,0:03:16.70,0:03:18.32,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,用那个神奇的口袋\Nふしぎなポッケで
Dialogue: 0,0:03:18.32,0:03:22.54,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,来帮我实现愿望啊\Nかなえてくれる
Dialogue: 0,0:03:22.70,0:03:26.54,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好想自由自在的在天空飞翔\Nそらをじゆうに　とびたいな
Dialogue: 0,0:03:26.54,0:03:29.54,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,“来！给你竹蜻蜓！”\N“ハイ！タケコプター”
Dialogue: 0,0:03:30.20,0:03:32.10,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,啊　啊　啊\Nアン　アン　アン
Dialogue: 0,0:03:32.10,0:03:37.54,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我最喜欢小叮当了\Nとってもだいすきドラえもん
Dialogue: 0,0:03:38.20,0:03:40.05,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,啊　啊　啊\Nアン　アン　アン
Dialogue: 0,0:03:40.05,0:03:45.54,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我最喜欢小叮当了\Nとってもだいすきドラえもん
Dialogue: 0,0:04:02.83,0:04:08.87,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,真是的 小叮当真无情\N小木马也很需要很多牧场的啊
Dialogue: 0,0:04:09.25,0:04:11.66,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,今晚如果大家来找我\N我该怎么办呢?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:12.00,0:04:14.58,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你拜托妈妈 跟他们说我不在家吧
Dialogue: 0,0:04:15.00,0:04:16.41,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,真无聊...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:18.00,0:04:19.83,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,气死人了
Dialogue: 0,0:04:20.00,0:04:21.25,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你怎么了?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:21.66,0:04:22.50,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是大雄啊
Dialogue: 0,0:04:22.83,0:04:23.75,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这是什么?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:24.08,0:04:27.41,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,22世纪在拍卖的安慰奖
Dialogue: 0,0:04:27.66,0:04:30.83,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好棒呀安慰奖\N居然也能得到一个星球
Dialogue: 0,0:04:31.00,0:04:32.91,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们就在那里盖牧场吧?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:32.91,0:04:34.16,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你想得太简单了
Dialogue: 0,0:04:34.50,0:04:36.91,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这些只是位于火星跟木星之间
Dialogue: 0,0:04:37.16,0:04:42.41,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,上千万个没用的小星球当中\N一个毫无用处的星球罢了
Dialogue: 0,0:04:42.66,0:04:45.00,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,什么? 真是令人失望
Dialogue: 0,0:04:45.58,0:04:48.83,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不过还是去确认看看\N拿任意门出来给我
Dialogue: 0,0:04:49.04,0:04:50.87,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,根本是白费心机的
Dialogue: 0,0:04:51.70,0:04:53.16,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,如果还不错的话
Dialogue: 0,0:04:53.50,0:04:55.83,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,绝对不可能 因为那是安慰奖呀
Dialogue: 0,0:04:56.16,0:04:58.66,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,带我到SSS-LM-303星球去
Dialogue: 0,0:04:59.08,0:04:59.83,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,啊...等待一下
Dialogue: 0,0:05:00.08,0:05:03.04,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,外面是外太空随便跑出去\N可是不得了的
Dialogue: 0,0:05:05.66,0:05:07.41,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,适应灯
Dialogue: 0,0:05:08.66,0:05:11.16,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,只要照过这个\N到什么地方都能适应
Dialogue: 0,0:05:11.75,0:05:15.33,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那再来一次\N带我到SSS-LM-303星球
Dialogue: 0,0:05:15.70,0:05:17.04,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,啊...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:17.54,0:05:18.41,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你没事吧?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:19.33,0:05:21.66,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这就是赠送的星球啊?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:21.91,0:05:23.58,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我不是早跟你说过吗
Dialogue: 0,0:05:24.08,0:05:26.00,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,再去别的星球上看看吧
Dialogue: 0,0:05:26.08,0:05:27.70,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,都一样 没用的
Dialogue: 0,0:05:28.08,0:05:30.50,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,到SSS-LM-205星球去
Dialogue: 0,0:05:31.16,0:05:32.87,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,挺大的啊
Dialogue: 0,0:05:33.75,0:05:36.50,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不行 石头都松开了
Dialogue: 0,0:05:36.70,0:05:39.04,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,所以才拿来当安慰奖啊
Dialogue: 0,0:05:39.41,0:05:42.00,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,到SSS-OH-9984星球
Dialogue: 0,0:05:42.37,0:05:43.50,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,太小了
Dialogue: 0,0:05:44.75,0:05:47.91,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,接着是SSS-UV-207星球
Dialogue: 0,0:05:48.37,0:05:50.37,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这根本不能用
Dialogue: 0,0:05:52.58,0:05:56.00,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,到SSS-NN-75112星球
Dialogue: 0,0:05:56.50,0:05:58.25,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好大...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:59.04,0:06:02.25,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这颗星球怎么是空心的?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:03.00,0:06:06.00,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,到SSS-VU-38454星球
Dialogue: 0,0:06:06.75,0:06:09.33,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,到SSS...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:09.70,0:06:12.41,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,到SSS-...-577...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:15.41,0:06:18.08,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,到SSS-PQ-5745...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:18.50,0:06:20.54,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,只剩下一张啊
Dialogue: 0,0:06:21.04,0:06:22.83,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大雄...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:23.16,0:06:25.20,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是技安他们 怎么办?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:25.75,0:06:27.00,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,小木马 快躲起来
Dialogue: 0,0:06:30.83,0:06:34.83,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们说好今晚开始\N要一起做暑假作业
Dialogue: 0,0:06:35.08,0:06:36.54,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你们真乖啊
Dialogue: 0,0:06:37.04,0:06:38.00,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,只剩下一张了
Dialogue: 0,0:06:38.16,0:06:40.33,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,没办法 待会我再想办法吧
Dialogue: 0,0:06:40.83,0:06:43.08,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,到SSS-BC-555
Dialogue: 0,0:06:44.16,0:06:45.87,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,晚安
Dialogue: 0,0:06:46.04,0:06:48.00,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哦? 准备好了啊
Dialogue: 0,0:06:48.04,0:06:49.58,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,原来是真的
Dialogue: 0,0:06:49.66,0:06:50.16,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那我们就...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:50.33,0:06:53.33,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,唉...等一下 为了以防万一
Dialogue: 0,0:06:54.37,0:06:55.66,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,适应灯
Dialogue: 0,0:06:58.58,0:07:01.66,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大雄 门那边真的有牧场啊?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:02.16,0:07:03.50,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你自己去看啊
Dialogue: 0,0:07:03.83,0:07:04.87,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那我就打开了
Dialogue: 0,0:07:05.91,0:07:07.00,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,小叮当...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:07.70,0:07:10.00,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哗...好棒呀
Dialogue: 0,0:07:10.20,0:07:10.91,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好棒?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:11.16,0:07:12.16,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,什么好棒啊?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:14.50,0:07:16.33,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,真的好像在做梦一样
Dialogue: 0,0:07:16.50,0:07:18.00,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我输了
Dialogue: 0,0:07:18.50,0:07:20.87,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这真是世上最棒的牧场
Dialogue: 0,0:07:21.33,0:07:22.20,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不可能的
Dialogue: 0,0:07:23.50,0:07:24.41,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不可能?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:26.33,0:07:27.83,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,怎么有这只马?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:28.25,0:07:30.66,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好可爱 跟木玩偶一样
Dialogue: 0,0:07:30.83,0:07:32.33,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这是不是玩具马啊
Dialogue: 0,0:07:32.66,0:07:34.83,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,才不是 它是活的
Dialogue: 0,0:07:36.08,0:07:37.83,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,生命发条
Dialogue: 0,0:07:38.33,0:07:42.75,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,只要上了这个发条\N任何玩偶都能活动
Dialogue: 0,0:07:43.16,0:07:45.16,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我的玩偶也行吗?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:45.33,0:07:46.58,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我的遥控车也可可以吗?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:46.75,0:07:49.66,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,当然了\N车子会像真车一样可以发动
Dialogue: 0,0:07:49.87,0:07:51.16,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那我回家去拿
Dialogue: 0,0:07:51.37,0:07:52.70,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我也要 我也要
Dialogue: 0,0:07:54.04,0:07:57.75,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,真没想到安慰奖\N会有这么好的东西
Dialogue: 0,0:07:58.33,0:08:00.83,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,有什么关系 既然送给你了
Dialogue: 0,0:08:05.04,0:08:07.08,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,麻烦你把它们上发条吧
Dialogue: 0,0:08:07.50,0:08:08.16,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好的
Dialogue: 0,0:08:17.04,0:08:18.66,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好棒 就跟活的一样
Dialogue: 0,0:08:19.33,0:08:21.04,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,真的是活的啊
Dialogue: 0,0:08:21.41,0:08:23.16,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那我的也要
Dialogue: 0,0:08:24.25,0:08:26.20,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,万一它发起狂来 那不是很可怕?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:26.50,0:08:29.58,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大雄 你敢对它差别待遇啊
Dialogue: 0,0:08:29.75,0:08:30.91,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好啦
Dialogue: 0,0:08:31.54,0:08:33.25,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我也帮你的玩偶上发条吧
Dialogue: 0,0:08:34.33,0:08:37.66,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我突然想起来\N我们可以作个玩具都市啊
Dialogue: 0,0:08:38.50,0:08:40.37,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,建立发条都市
Dialogue: 0,0:08:40.66,0:08:42.00,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,赞成...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:42.54,0:08:46.33,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,今天己经很晚了\N明天开始我们的工程
Dialogue: 0,0:08:46.75,0:08:49.50,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好啊 太棒了
Dialogue: 0,0:09:02.33,0:09:03.50,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,建好了
Dialogue: 0,0:09:03.70,0:09:04.66,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好漂亮
Dialogue: 0,0:09:04.87,0:09:06.33,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,都是小叮当的功劳
Dialogue: 0,0:09:06.66,0:09:10.16,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是大家的玩偶都市
Dialogue: 0,0:09:11.04,0:09:12.66,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是发条都市
Dialogue: 0,0:09:13.00,0:09:17.00,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,没错 是发条都市\N先请宜静带我们去参观
Dialogue: 0,0:09:17.20,0:09:18.08,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好的
Dialogue: 0,0:09:18.66,0:09:20.54,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是娃娃的家啊
Dialogue: 0,0:09:20.75,0:09:23.33,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这是玛丽跟莉莉小姐\N这位是杰克先生
Dialogue: 0,0:09:23.58,0:09:26.54,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,小叮当用放大灯把他们放大的
Dialogue: 0,0:09:26.83,0:09:28.08,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,还有这里
Dialogue: 0,0:09:28.50,0:09:32.54,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,有服装店面包店还有花店耶
Dialogue: 0,0:09:33.04,0:09:34.70,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这里是发条都市的商店街啊
Dialogue: 0,0:09:35.16,0:09:36.87,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,阿福你做的呢?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:37.33,0:09:38.70,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我的店在这里
Dialogue: 0,0:09:38.91,0:09:40.00,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,店?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:40.41,0:09:46.20,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是汽车公司\N什么车都有 宜静如何?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:46.66,0:09:47.83,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,要不要帮杰克买一部车?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:48.16,0:09:50.08,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是啊 他一定很高兴
Dialogue: 0,0:09:50.50,0:09:52.20,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,请各位来看看我的公司
Dialogue: 0,0:09:52.58,0:09:53.66,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,技安的公司?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:54.16,0:09:55.33,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,一定很有趣
Dialogue: 0,0:09:58.25,0:10:00.33,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,技安建设股份有限公司
Dialogue: 0,0:10:01.00,0:10:03.83,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不管是桥梁道路\N或是大楼的建设工程
Dialogue: 0,0:10:04.00,0:10:04.83,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们都承包
Dialogue: 0,0:10:05.16,0:10:06.87,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你一个人啊
Dialogue: 0,0:10:07.08,0:10:11.50,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不是是玩具们他们都很认真的工作
Dialogue: 0,0:10:11.66,0:10:13.25,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我只是在一旁监督
Dialogue: 0,0:10:13.37,0:10:14.16,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,什么嘛
Dialogue: 0,0:10:15.20,0:10:16.66,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,很像技安的作风啊
Dialogue: 0,0:10:16.83,0:10:19.75,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,对了 蛋差不多孵化了
Dialogue: 0,0:10:20.20,0:10:21.16,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,蛋?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:22.08,0:10:24.25,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好大的蛋啊
Dialogue: 0,0:10:24.54,0:10:25.70,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这里是“蛋蛋屋”
Dialogue: 0,0:10:25.83,0:10:27.00,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,里面有什么啊?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:27.50,0:10:30.16,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我想 只有小木马跟小猪他们\N会很寂寞的
Dialogue: 0,0:10:32.54,0:10:34.70,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好多蛋
Dialogue: 0,0:10:35.41,0:10:37.00,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这些是什么蛋啊
Dialogue: 0,0:10:37.33,0:10:38.83,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,差不多要孵化了
Dialogue: 0,0:10:39.16,0:10:40.75,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,真的在动了
Dialogue: 0,0:10:45.75,0:10:48.16,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,马居然从蛋里孵出来
Dialogue: 0,0:10:48.58,0:10:50.41,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,别这么惊讶嘛
Dialogue: 0,0:10:50.87,0:10:54.66,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好不容易有这么宽敞的牧场\N当然要多一点伙伴啊
Dialogue: 0,0:10:55.00,0:10:57.20,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,蛋复制镜
Dialogue: 0,0:10:58.04,0:11:00.41,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,上发条的玩偶只有一个
Dialogue: 0,0:11:00.70,0:11:04.00,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,所以靠这个复制镜\N就能复制出很多相同的蛋
Dialogue: 0,0:11:04.41,0:11:08.04,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,一经孵化\N就会变成同样大小优良的动物
Dialogue: 0,0:11:08.41,0:11:11.70,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,顺便增加其他动物吧
Dialogue: 0,0:11:20.20,0:11:22.70,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,怎样 很像真的牧场了吧
Dialogue: 0,0:11:28.04,0:11:29.41,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大雄你做了什么?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:30.00,0:11:31.70,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我发射了一枚人造卫星
Dialogue: 0,0:11:32.50,0:11:35.54,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,它会从太空中\N把这一带的照片传送回来
Dialogue: 0,0:11:35.83,0:11:39.04,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,信箱里面应该已经有照片了
Dialogue: 0,0:11:42.00,0:11:44.00,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,除了这个牧场之外\N其他地方都是森林
Dialogue: 0,0:11:44.04,0:11:46.83,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,万一迷了路一定走不出来的
Dialogue: 0,0:11:47.00,0:11:49.66,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,真是充满谜团的神秘森林
Dialogue: 0,0:11:49.83,0:11:50.58,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这是什么?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:50.70,0:11:51.75,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不是湖泊吗?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:53.33,0:11:56.16,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,底下好像有个发光的物体
Dialogue: 0,0:11:56.37,0:11:57.50,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,发光的物体?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:57.83,0:12:00.50,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,搞不好是大金块哦 怎么可能
Dialogue: 0,0:12:00.66,0:12:03.66,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,决定了 我们去森林里探险
Dialogue: 0,0:12:04.08,0:12:05.41,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这倒很有趣
Dialogue: 0,0:12:05.41,0:12:09.75,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,顺便带玩偶们去看看
Dialogue: 0,0:12:10.16,0:12:12.50,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,叮当探险队出发了
Dialogue: 0,0:12:12.50,0:12:16.55,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,脑袋上有什么 闪闪发光\Nあたまテカテカ　さえてビカビカ
Dialogue: 0,0:12:17.00,0:12:19.00,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那是为什么...\Nそれたどうした...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:24.83,0:12:26.50,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好像很可怕
Dialogue: 0,0:12:27.25,0:12:29.25,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,别害怕 有我在
Dialogue: 0,0:12:29.54,0:12:32.00,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不管是魔鬼还是狮子 都给我出来
Dialogue: 0,0:12:32.33,0:12:33.50,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,玩具变的啊
Dialogue: 0,0:12:34.70,0:12:39.00,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,未来世界的 猫型机器人\Nみらいのせかいの　ネコがたロボット
Dialogue: 0,0:12:39.20,0:12:43.20,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不管遇到什么 我是小叮当\Nどんなもんだい　ぼくドラえもん
Dialogue: 0,0:12:46.33,0:12:47.87,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好累啊
Dialogue: 0,0:12:47.87,0:12:50.16,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你走的慢吞吞的会跟不上的
Dialogue: 0,0:12:50.66,0:12:52.50,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那我们就在这里吃便当吧
Dialogue: 0,0:12:53.20,0:12:55.00,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,开动了
Dialogue: 0,0:12:57.04,0:12:59.75,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好安静 只有风声
Dialogue: 0,0:13:00.58,0:13:03.08,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,地球上可能没有这种地方了
Dialogue: 0,0:13:14.08,0:13:15.25,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你怎么了?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:15.83,0:13:16.91,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,有人在说话
Dialogue: 0,0:13:17.66,0:13:19.00,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,谁?  谁呢?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:19.70,0:13:22.16,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他说“滚出去 滚出去”
Dialogue: 0,0:13:24.66,0:13:26.33,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,没有声音啊
Dialogue: 0,0:13:26.66,0:13:28.33,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是你听错了吧
Dialogue: 0,0:13:28.54,0:13:30.83,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,真的有人在说话啦
Dialogue: 0,0:13:31.16,0:13:32.91,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,可能是树叶摩擦的声音吧
Dialogue: 0,0:13:33.66,0:13:36.37,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,槽糕 有乌云飘过来了
Dialogue: 0,0:13:37.70,0:13:40.04,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,下雨了
Dialogue: 0,0:13:41.00,0:13:42.41,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好大的雨
Dialogue: 0,0:13:42.70,0:13:43.70,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,快回去吧
Dialogue: 0,0:13:53.00,0:13:55.87,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,地球上没有这种雨啊
Dialogue: 0,0:14:26.04,0:14:26.91,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他们呢?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:27.58,0:14:29.25,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你们没事吧
Dialogue: 0,0:14:31.37,0:14:32.54,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,小叮当
Dialogue: 0,0:14:32.70,0:14:34.41,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大雄 你好棒
Dialogue: 0,0:14:34.91,0:14:36.75,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,还好没掉到海里面
Dialogue: 0,0:14:37.50,0:14:41.33,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,没想到会有大洪水
Dialogue: 0,0:14:41.54,0:14:44.83,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,看来我的建设公司\N得把这里的河道挖宽点
Dialogue: 0,0:14:45.16,0:14:48.08,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我很担心那些玩偶 我们回去吧
Dialogue: 0,0:14:48.25,0:14:51.08,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,嗯 顺着河走应该就会到
Dialogue: 0,0:14:52.20,0:14:53.83,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们被冲的好远
Dialogue: 0,0:14:56.33,0:14:57.50,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,就在那边
Dialogue: 0,0:14:59.70,0:15:01.70,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,蛋蛋屋焦掉了
Dialogue: 0,0:15:02.66,0:15:04.66,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,似乎被雷打到了
Dialogue: 0,0:15:05.16,0:15:06.33,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,里面没问题吧
Dialogue: 0,0:15:06.66,0:15:07.87,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们去看看
Dialogue: 0,0:15:08.75,0:15:11.91,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,还好蛋好像都没事
Dialogue: 0,0:15:12.41,0:15:13.54,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,太好了
Dialogue: 0,0:15:13.81,0:15:15.54,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,小叮当 快来这里
Dialogue: 0,0:15:16.25,0:15:18.04,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,可能是因为冲击而掉了下去
Dialogue: 0,0:15:21.83,0:15:23.83,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你们好 我叫做皮姆
Dialogue: 0,0:15:24.00,0:15:25.08,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你会说话啊
Dialogue: 0,0:15:25.66,0:15:28.75,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,可能是刚才雷电的能量造成的吧
Dialogue: 0,0:15:29.50,0:15:31.08,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,头脑真好
Dialogue: 0,0:15:51.16,0:15:53.58,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,今早5点左右前科累累的罪犯
Dialogue: 0,0:15:54.04,0:16:01.37,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,熊虎鬼五郎从监狱中脱逃\N便失去了行踪
Dialogue: 0,0:16:01.50,0:16:02.33,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好可怕
Dialogue: 0,0:16:02.70,0:16:05.75,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我去告诉在2楼的孩子们吧
Dialogue: 0,0:16:06.00,0:16:08.66,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不用了 在我们家很安全的
Dialogue: 0,0:16:09.33,0:16:10.25,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是吗?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:10.83,0:16:15.66,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,而且他们也不希望被打扰\N好不容易才这么认真
Dialogue: 0,0:16:21.58,0:16:23.00,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,都没人在啊
Dialogue: 0,0:16:23.66,0:16:24.91,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这扇门是什么?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:28.83,0:16:30.70,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这是哪里啊
Dialogue: 0,0:16:31.25,0:16:34.54,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,真没想到有这么大片的森林
Dialogue: 0,0:16:35.04,0:16:38.50,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,找个藏身的地方吧
Dialogue: 0,0:16:39.66,0:16:40.58,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,有人来了
Dialogue: 0,0:16:43.66,0:16:46.41,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,明天我要一口气\N把堤防的工程给完成
Dialogue: 0,0:16:46.66,0:16:49.04,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,让这颗星球更适合住人
Dialogue: 0,0:16:49.41,0:16:50.50,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我好期待啊
Dialogue: 0,0:16:51.04,0:16:53.83,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我会教他们念书的
Dialogue: 0,0:16:54.04,0:16:55.66,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我想是他们教你才对
Dialogue: 0,0:16:56.20,0:16:57.00,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,说的对
Dialogue: 0,0:16:58.83,0:17:01.04,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,门不见了
Dialogue: 0,0:17:01.54,0:17:03.08,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他们说这颗星球...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:03.66,0:17:06.91,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这里到底是哪里?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:13.08,0:17:14.70,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,伯母 我们回去了
Dialogue: 0,0:17:14.91,0:17:16.75,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,技安 麻烦你送宜静回家
Dialogue: 0,0:17:17.00,0:17:18.16,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,交给我吧
Dialogue: 0,0:17:18.41,0:17:20.70,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,如果碰到那个坏人\N我会把他抓起来的
Dialogue: 0,0:17:21.08,0:17:22.20,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你真是勇敢
Dialogue: 0,0:17:22.83,0:17:24.66,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那明天见了
Dialogue: 0,0:17:25.04,0:17:26.04,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,晚安
Dialogue: 0,0:17:26.50,0:17:28.83,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,明天的堤防工程就拜托你了
Dialogue: 0,0:17:29.08,0:17:30.04,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,堤防工程?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:30.50,0:17:33.20,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是我们的自由习作啦
Dialogue: 0,0:17:48.66,0:17:52.33,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不愧是技安建设公司\N能做出这么棒的堤防来
Dialogue: 0,0:17:52.83,0:17:55.08,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,现在就算下大雨也不需要担心了
Dialogue: 0,0:17:55.70,0:17:58.33,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,接着再架桥来做调整公路
Dialogue: 0,0:17:58.58,0:18:00.91,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,然后再建造新干线
Dialogue: 0,0:18:01.16,0:18:04.20,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,也要盖工厂哦 我要当...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:06.91,0:18:09.50,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这颗行星上面只有这几个小孩啊
Dialogue: 0,0:18:10.70,0:18:12.83,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,只要有那扇奇妙的门...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:13.87,0:18:15.00,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好
Dialogue: 0,0:18:17.70,0:18:27.25,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,滚出去...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:27.50,0:18:32.04,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是谁? 给我出来 给我出来
Dialogue: 0,0:18:35.54,0:18:38.08,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这片森林真让人不舒服
Dialogue: 0,0:18:46.08,0:18:48.37,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这次是不是能顺利呢?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:53.33,0:18:55.33,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你叫什么名字?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:55.58,0:18:57.91,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我叫波比 你好
Dialogue: 0,0:18:58.20,0:19:00.50,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我是小叮当 请多多指教
Dialogue: 0,0:19:00.75,0:19:01.87,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,请多指教
Dialogue: 0,0:19:02.70,0:19:04.83,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,果然受到雷电的影响
Dialogue: 0,0:19:06.16,0:19:08.04,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我帮你介绍些明友
Dialogue: 0,0:19:08.33,0:19:09.50,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,朋友?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:15.37,0:19:18.50,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,蛋? 这里是养鸡啊?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:19.83,0:19:20.91,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这是什么?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:21.91,0:19:23.33,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,镜子啊
Dialogue: 0,0:19:25.54,0:19:29.20,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这是什么? 好恶心
Dialogue: 0,0:19:32.54,0:19:35.08,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,到处是奇怪的事物
Dialogue: 0,0:19:40.83,0:19:43.91,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,第一步先从这个小镇开始吧
Dialogue: 0,0:19:47.50,0:19:49.04,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,反抗我的人格杀勿论
Dialogue: 0,0:19:56.66,0:19:58.66,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这里居然有警察
Dialogue: 0,0:20:06.00,0:20:09.25,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,杰克 超速是不对的
Dialogue: 0,0:20:10.08,0:20:11.16,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,虽然才刚生出来不久
Dialogue: 0,0:20:11.37,0:20:13.87,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但皮姆跟波比都喜欢看书
Dialogue: 0,0:20:14.54,0:20:17.37,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们也该来做暑假作业了
Dialogue: 0,0:20:18.16,0:20:19.50,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,就是啊
Dialogue: 0,0:20:22.04,0:20:24.08,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,暑假作业啊 才刚放假啊
Dialogue: 0,0:20:24.37,0:20:27.37,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,差一点高速公路就要完成了
Dialogue: 0,0:20:27.75,0:20:33.66,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,虽然暑假还有很久\N但还是每天做一点比较妥当
Dialogue: 0,0:21:31.50,0:21:32.75,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你们是谁?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:33.16,0:21:34.70,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我是熊虎鬼五郎
Dialogue: 0,0:21:35.33,0:21:38.16,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,胡说 我才是鬼五郎
Dialogue: 0,0:21:38.54,0:21:40.25,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不 我是鬼五郎
Dialogue: 0,0:21:40.50,0:21:41.66,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我才是
Dialogue: 0,0:21:41.83,0:21:43.75,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我是 我才是
Dialogue: 0,0:21:45.16,0:21:46.16,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,别吵了
Dialogue: 0,0:21:46.91,0:21:47.75,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,把经过详细跟我说明
Dialogue: 0,0:21:48.16,0:21:50.87,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,什么? 从蛋里面孵化的?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:52.00,0:21:55.37,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,原来那是是复制的机器
Dialogue: 0,0:21:55.83,0:21:57.00,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这里是那里啊
Dialogue: 0,0:21:57.41,0:21:59.91,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这里啊 这里不是地球
Dialogue: 0,0:22:01.00,0:22:02.83,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,虽然不是地球
Dialogue: 0,0:22:03.00,0:22:06.00,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,却可以透过一扇奇妙的门\N跟地球连接
Dialogue: 0,0:22:06.33,0:22:12.00,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,既然伙伴增加了 那力量也变强了\N怎么样 来统治这个星球吧
Dialogue: 0,0:22:12.37,0:22:13.16,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这个星球?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:13.33,0:22:14.04,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,没错
Dialogue: 0,0:22:14.50,0:22:16.70,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这个星球上\N只有拥有奇妙道具的蓝色狸猫
Dialogue: 0,0:22:16.83,0:22:18.50,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,跟那四个孩子以及一些玩偶家畜
Dialogue: 0,0:22:18.54,0:22:22.83,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,要抢实在太容易了
Dialogue: 0,0:22:23.04,0:22:23.83,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,太棒了
Dialogue: 0,0:22:24.16,0:22:25.75,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们把这个星球抢过来吧
Dialogue: 0,0:22:26.00,0:22:27.66,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,把树都砍光来卖
Dialogue: 0,0:22:27.75,0:22:29.00,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,能赚好多钱呢
Dialogue: 0,0:22:29.16,0:22:30.58,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,笨蛋 盖饭店才好
Dialogue: 0,0:22:30.87,0:22:32.37,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,谁说的 赌场才好
Dialogue: 0,0:22:35.16,0:22:38.33,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,吵死了 你们只是我的分身
Dialogue: 0,0:22:38.66,0:22:40.33,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,谁都不许有意见 只要听我...不
Dialogue: 0,0:22:40.50,0:22:42.83,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,听从我这个社长的话就行
Dialogue: 0,0:22:43.20,0:22:44.33,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是的
Dialogue: 0,0:22:44.87,0:22:47.87,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,别太着急 再看看情况吧
Dialogue: 0,0:22:56.54,0:22:58.00,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你在堤防上种花啊
Dialogue: 0,0:22:58.50,0:22:59.70,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这是快速增长花啊
Dialogue: 0,0:23:00.04,0:23:03.33,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我在高速公路两旁\N种了树 一起去看看吧
Dialogue: 0,0:23:03.33,0:23:03.87,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好啊
Dialogue: 0,0:23:07.41,0:23:09.66,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,到处都是绿色真令人高兴
Dialogue: 0,0:23:10.20,0:23:11.83,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 大雄\N- 什么事?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:12.04,0:23:14.66,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我做了很多强力的太阳能电池
Dialogue: 0,0:23:14.91,0:23:17.37,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,发条玩偶们只要有了这个\N就没有问题了
Dialogue: 0,0:23:17.58,0:23:18.41,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,完成了
Dialogue: 0,0:23:19.16,0:23:22.04,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我根据卫星传回的相片\N画了这幅地图
Dialogue: 0,0:23:22.20,0:23:23.00,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你们看看
Dialogue: 0,0:23:23.66,0:23:26.25,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我打算把高速公路\N造到火山口湖那里
Dialogue: 0,0:23:26.66,0:23:29.91,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,各位 今天要不要去海水浴场玩?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:30.16,0:23:34.16,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,笨蛋 万一金块\N被人捷足先登取走怎么办?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:34.50,0:23:36.37,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,被人? 谁啊?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:36.83,0:23:39.70,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,对哦 这星球上面只有我们
Dialogue: 0,0:23:40.33,0:23:44.16,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这是个玩具船\N要不要坐在上面游河?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:44.54,0:23:45.50,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好啊
Dialogue: 0,0:23:46.00,0:23:47.16,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那就快点去吧
Dialogue: 0,0:23:47.33,0:23:48.00,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好啊
Dialogue: 0,0:23:53.00,0:23:53.70,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,小叮当
Dialogue: 0,0:23:54.04,0:23:54.83,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,没问题
Dialogue: 0,0:23:55.37,0:23:57.00,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,放大灯
Dialogue: 0,0:24:05.08,0:24:05.91,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,上去吧
Dialogue: 0,0:24:08.04,0:24:11.33,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我已经给它上了发条\N所以跟真船一样
Dialogue: 0,0:24:11.83,0:24:13.08,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那你就是船长
Dialogue: 0,0:24:13.58,0:24:14.50,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,交给我吧
Dialogue: 0,0:24:18.00,0:24:20.33,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,发条号 出航
Dialogue: 0,0:24:37.20,0:24:40.04,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,阿福 黑烟是不是太多了?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:40.33,0:24:41.75,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那是一定会的
Dialogue: 0,0:24:42.16,0:24:43.00,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是吗?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:45.16,0:24:48.04,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这是我们的星球啊\N不会有任何人袍怨的
Dialogue: 0,0:24:48.50,0:24:49.16,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,就是啊
Dialogue: 0,0:24:55.83,0:24:56.50,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你们看看
Dialogue: 0,0:24:56.54,0:24:58.25,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他们就是那群奇怪的孩子
Dialogue: 0,0:24:58.70,0:25:00.00,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,跟踪他们
Dialogue: 0,0:25:00.20,0:25:05.00,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,老大 老大 我捡到这个 你看看
Dialogue: 0,0:25:05.16,0:25:07.33,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,笨蛋 要叫我社长
Dialogue: 0,0:25:08.00,0:25:10.83,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这是什么?\N是那些小孩画的地图啊
Dialogue: 0,0:25:11.20,0:25:14.58,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,什么? 在那里有大金块
Dialogue: 0,0:25:14.91,0:25:17.83,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,别管他们了 金块比较重要
Dialogue: 0,0:25:20.25,0:25:21.50,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,根据这张地图
Dialogue: 0,0:25:22.50,0:25:27.00,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,金块的位置\N就是往这里一直走下去
Dialogue: 0,0:25:27.58,0:25:30.00,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,应该不会很远吧\N从这条路直走也要花点时间
Dialogue: 0,0:25:30.33,0:25:33.66,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,所以现在最好\N通过那道门回到地球去
Dialogue: 0,0:25:34.00,0:25:35.87,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,抢...不...
Dialogue: 0,0:25:36.20,0:25:37.58,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,准备一些食物过来
Dialogue: 0,0:25:37.66,0:25:38.83,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是...
Dialogue: 0,0:26:03.87,0:26:06.04,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大雄 你怎么不游泳?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:07.33,0:26:09.83,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,对了 大雄不会游泳
Dialogue: 0,0:26:10.16,0:26:14.33,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大雄 用复制制造出来的玩偶们\N也在海底了
Dialogue: 0,0:26:14.54,0:26:15.75,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,很漂亮的
Dialogue: 0,0:26:16.54,0:26:17.50,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是吗?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:44.33,0:26:47.87,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那是我用放大灯\N把鲸鱼的布偶给放大的
Dialogue: 0,0:26:48.16,0:26:49.33,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好好玩
Dialogue: 0,0:26:50.04,0:26:52.58,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,对了 我的恐龙到哪去了?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:52.91,0:26:54.75,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我把它放大 打算跟它玩的
Dialogue: 0,0:26:54.87,0:26:56.66,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,可能在森林里睡午觉吧
Dialogue: 0,0:26:57.08,0:26:58.75,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,它又不是大雄
Dialogue: 0,0:27:01.25,0:27:03.66,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,技安 你怎么那么说我
Dialogue: 0,0:27:05.87,0:27:09.04,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好 大家的食物跟水都带齐全了吗?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:09.25,0:27:10.25,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是
Dialogue: 0,0:27:10.70,0:27:12.58,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 老大\N- 叫我社长
Dialogue: 0,0:27:13.25,0:27:15.87,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,社长\N因为我们都长的一样很难分辫
Dialogue: 0,0:27:16.16,0:27:18.66,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,所以请社长戴上这顶帽子\N这样比较像社长
Dialogue: 0,0:27:20.16,0:27:22.08,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这个主意好
Dialogue: 0,0:27:22.20,0:27:23.33,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我的点子不错吧
Dialogue: 0,0:27:23.50,0:27:26.00,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,各位朝着大金块的方向出发吧...
Dialogue: 0,0:27:26.41,0:27:27.33,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是
Dialogue: 0,0:27:30.58,0:27:31.87,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,黑痣
Dialogue: 0,0:27:32.20,0:27:33.00,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,黑痣?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:33.20,0:27:35.16,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,没错 你鼻子下面有颗黑痣
Dialogue: 0,0:27:35.54,0:27:36.66,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,所以我叫你黑痣
Dialogue: 0,0:27:37.08,0:27:37.75,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哦
Dialogue: 0,0:27:38.00,0:27:39.33,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这个你拿好
Dialogue: 0,0:27:40.58,0:27:42.04,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这是什么?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:42.58,0:27:46.08,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是我从消防署拿来的梯子\N就由你来搬吧
Dialogue: 0,0:27:52.08,0:27:55.25,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,社长 这么重的梯子 要用来干嘛?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:55.66,0:27:57.20,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,等一下就能派上用场了
Dialogue: 0,0:27:57.66,0:27:59.08,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,中途能不能换你拿呢?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:59.37,0:28:02.25,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我可是社长耶 谁跟你换着拿 笨蛋
Dialogue: 0,0:28:03.70,0:28:04.37,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,吵死了
Dialogue: 0,0:28:06.70,0:28:08.50,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大家好不好呢?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:10.75,0:28:13.20,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,各位 谢谢你们
Dialogue: 0,0:28:13.70,0:28:15.54,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,它们在干什么啊?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:16.00,0:28:20.00,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,如果我能当选市长\N我一定会尽我的全力
Dialogue: 0,0:28:20.16,0:28:23.04,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,把发条城市建造成一个...
Dialogue: 0,0:28:23.20,0:28:24.91,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,原来是在选举
Dialogue: 0,0:28:25.25,0:28:27.33,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,居然学人类 真可爱
Dialogue: 0,0:28:27.83,0:28:28.58,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,就是啊
Dialogue: 0,0:28:29.16,0:28:32.37,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我一定不会让这个星球受到污染
Dialogue: 0,0:28:34.87,0:28:39.50,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,其它玩偶也越来越人性化了
Dialogue: 0,0:28:42.58,0:28:44.25,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,社长 这个梯子...
Dialogue: 0,0:28:44.58,0:28:46.83,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你是我的分伸 没有资格说话
Dialogue: 0,0:28:47.00,0:28:48.00,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,可是我...
Dialogue: 0,0:28:50.16,0:28:51.91,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那是什么声音?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:56.00,0:28:58.33,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,原来是玩具鹦鹉啊
Dialogue: 0,0:28:58.66,0:29:00.41,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,社长
Dialogue: 0,0:29:00.83,0:29:01.58,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,发生什么事?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:11.16,0:29:13.70,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,看清楚点 那是玩偶啊
Dialogue: 0,0:29:14.83,0:29:16.66,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,吓死人了
Dialogue: 0,0:29:17.00,0:29:19.00,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,一个个都这样 这哪像我的分身
Dialogue: 0,0:29:19.33,0:29:20.37,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,真是群胆小鬼
Dialogue: 0,0:29:21.37,0:29:23.54,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,别在这里玩 快点出发
Dialogue: 0,0:29:24.50,0:29:26.04,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,黑痣 快点
Dialogue: 0,0:29:26.37,0:29:28.33,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,再慢吞吞的就把你丢在这里
Dialogue: 0,0:30:40.50,0:30:41.66,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,结束了
Dialogue: 0,0:30:42.33,0:30:43.16,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,再坐一次
Dialogue: 0,0:30:43.33,0:30:45.20,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不行 回去了
Dialogue: 0,0:31:27.41,0:31:28.25,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你好啊
Dialogue: 0,0:31:30.33,0:31:32.83,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这个人怎么这么有礼貌
Dialogue: 0,0:32:06.04,0:32:10.50,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大雄 是谁来了?\N我马上送果汁上去
Dialogue: 0,0:32:15.20,0:32:18.08,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他们到底在研究什么啊?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:19.00,0:32:21.33,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,今天也好有趣
Dialogue: 0,0:32:21.66,0:32:24.50,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,明天一定要把桥梁架好\N给你们看看
Dialogue: 0,0:32:24.58,0:32:25.33,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,咦?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:26.16,0:32:29.00,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我还以为有人来呢?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:29.58,0:32:30.54,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,没有啊
Dialogue: 0,0:32:37.83,0:32:40.16,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,社长 天都黑了
Dialogue: 0,0:32:40.50,0:32:43.20,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那些孩子们画的地图真的准吗?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:44.00,0:32:46.33,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,黑痣 你看那个
Dialogue: 0,0:32:52.75,0:32:55.00,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大金块就在附近
Dialogue: 0,0:32:55.16,0:32:59.25,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,等明天天一亮\N我们就爬到山的那边去
Dialogue: 0,0:32:59.58,0:33:01.25,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,今晚就在这里扎营吧
Dialogue: 0,0:33:01.58,0:33:02.58,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是
Dialogue: 0,0:33:22.83,0:33:24.00,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,拉上去
Dialogue: 0,0:33:38.70,0:33:42.41,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,已经爬过岩石山了\N只要再过了断崖
Dialogue: 0,0:33:43.00,0:33:44.83,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,就是大金块存在之地了
Dialogue: 0,0:33:50.37,0:33:51.50,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,起风了
Dialogue: 0,0:33:57.54,0:33:58.54,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,社长
Dialogue: 0,0:33:59.50,0:34:01.50,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这点风算什么
Dialogue: 0,0:34:02.54,0:34:07.66,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,立刻滚出我们的星球
Dialogue: 0,0:34:08.54,0:34:18.37,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,如果不走 就会发生很可怕的事哦
Dialogue: 0,0:34:20.25,0:34:22.66,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,社长 这里有妖怪耶
Dialogue: 0,0:34:22.87,0:34:25.25,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,笨蛋 那只是风声
Dialogue: 0,0:34:32.50,0:34:36.37,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,等到高速公路都完成后\N就到火口湖去寻找大金块
Dialogue: 0,0:34:36.66,0:34:37.50,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,赞成
Dialogue: 0,0:34:37.83,0:34:38.66,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那我开门了
Dialogue: 0,0:34:41.33,0:34:45.83,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那里又发生大风暴了\N等风势小一点再去吧
Dialogue: 0,0:34:46.16,0:34:47.16,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好吧
Dialogue: 0,0:34:48.83,0:34:53.16,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,别畏缩 只是打雷罢了
Dialogue: 0,0:34:54.16,0:34:56.66,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,如果有妖怪的话就给我出来
Dialogue: 0,0:35:06.70,0:35:08.83,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哈哈...
Dialogue: 0,0:35:09.04,0:35:13.66,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,瞧瞧 因为害怕我们的勇气\N暴风雨 雷电都散开了
Dialogue: 0,0:35:14.00,0:35:18.00,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,走吧 马上就到大断层了 出发
Dialogue: 0,0:35:18.83,0:35:23.41,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,呼...呼...呼...
Dialogue: 0,0:35:29.08,0:35:32.87,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,刚才的那场暴风雨又发生雷击了
Dialogue: 0,0:35:33.16,0:35:35.00,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,小叮当先生 请为我们高兴
Dialogue: 0,0:35:35.33,0:35:37.20,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,因为如此我们又有新成员了
Dialogue: 0,0:35:38.20,0:35:39.54,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,现在就为各位介绍
Dialogue: 0,0:35:41.33,0:35:42.83,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我是牛因斯坦
Dialogue: 0,0:35:43.08,0:35:45.16,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我是羊迪生
Dialogue: 0,0:35:46.41,0:35:49.00,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我是小叮当 请多指教
Dialogue: 0,0:35:49.70,0:35:51.87,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这两只的名字真像大人物
Dialogue: 0,0:35:52.08,0:35:53.54,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,开始工程进度吧
Dialogue: 0,0:35:54.00,0:35:56.20,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,今天要不要去阿福的游乐场玩?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:56.66,0:35:58.00,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,赞成
Dialogue: 0,0:35:58.50,0:35:59.75,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那工程呢?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:00.25,0:36:01.37,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,延期到明天再做
Dialogue: 0,0:36:01.58,0:36:03.25,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你这个公司真是没原则
Dialogue: 0,0:36:03.54,0:36:04.87,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,有什么关系
Dialogue: 0,0:36:23.83,0:36:25.25,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,阿福 再玩一次吧
Dialogue: 0,0:36:25.66,0:36:28.33,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,等一下我们去玩旋转木马吧
Dialogue: 0,0:36:28.66,0:36:31.25,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好的 紧接着是旋转木马
Dialogue: 0,0:36:36.37,0:36:38.25,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,终于到达了
Dialogue: 0,0:36:43.00,0:36:44.54,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这里就是大断层了
Dialogue: 0,0:36:46.04,0:36:50.00,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,社长这里深不见底的\N要怎么过去呢?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:50.25,0:36:51.83,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,把梯子拉长
Dialogue: 0,0:36:52.33,0:36:53.16,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是
Dialogue: 0,0:36:55.50,0:36:56.91,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,就利用这个
Dialogue: 0,0:36:59.83,0:37:00.70,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,拉吧
Dialogue: 0,0:37:02.75,0:37:04.00,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,放下来的时候要轻放
Dialogue: 0,0:37:08.25,0:37:11.16,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,成功了 成功了
Dialogue: 0,0:37:12.00,0:37:14.33,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,黑痣 你先过去
Dialogue: 0,0:37:14.75,0:37:16.50,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不 社长先吧
Dialogue: 0,0:37:17.00,0:37:18.87,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,梯子是你搬运的
Dialogue: 0,0:37:19.83,0:37:20.83,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,可是... 快点去
Dialogue: 0,0:37:27.37,0:37:29.50,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我的脚抖个不停
Dialogue: 0,0:37:30.37,0:37:32.66,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,别看下面 一口气走过去
Dialogue: 0,0:37:33.33,0:37:34.00,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是
Dialogue: 0,0:37:37.66,0:37:39.33,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,安全了
Dialogue: 0,0:37:39.58,0:37:42.50,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,很好 那我就放心了
Dialogue: 0,0:37:42.91,0:37:44.91,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,一个个跟着我来
Dialogue: 0,0:37:46.66,0:37:47.50,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不愧是社长
Dialogue: 0,0:37:47.70,0:37:50.16,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,笨蛋 这很简单的啊
Dialogue: 0,0:37:50.70,0:37:54.25,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,马上就能见到大金块了
Dialogue: 0,0:38:05.08,0:38:07.20,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这是怎么回事?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:07.83,0:38:11.08,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好厉害 一个晚上\N就能盖出这样的大楼
Dialogue: 0,0:38:11.75,0:38:14.37,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,干嘛不来帮忙做我的工程
Dialogue: 0,0:38:15.75,0:38:18.16,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,希望你也能设计音乐厅
Dialogue: 0,0:38:18.58,0:38:20.00,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,还有图书馆
Dialogue: 0,0:38:21.25,0:38:23.87,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,小叮当先生 你们来的正是时候
Dialogue: 0,0:38:24.33,0:38:26.83,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,有点事想拜托你们
Dialogue: 0,0:38:27.16,0:38:28.66,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们俩?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:29.16,0:38:30.16,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,到底是什么事?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:31.54,0:38:36.50,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,拜托你们两位\N别再破坏这个星球的环境
Dialogue: 0,0:38:36.87,0:38:38.66,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们? 什么时候?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:39.70,0:38:44.50,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,阿福的车辆和船只所排放的废气\N都污染了空气
Dialogue: 0,0:38:45.20,0:38:50.04,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,希望可以利用小叮当先生的\N太阳能电池 来当作能源
Dialogue: 0,0:38:50.54,0:38:52.41,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好吧 就听你的
Dialogue: 0,0:38:52.70,0:38:56.50,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,紧接着是关于技安建设公司\N所造成的环境破坏
Dialogue: 0,0:38:56.87,0:38:58.58,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,拜托 那我也有话要说
Dialogue: 0,0:38:58.70,0:39:01.50,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你们还不是会盖很多大楼?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:02.16,0:39:03.37,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们的大楼都是使用
Dialogue: 0,0:39:03.54,0:39:08.58,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,牛因斯坦博士\N所发明的新建材所建造的
Dialogue: 0,0:39:09.16,0:39:11.50,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是我用泥土做成的陶凝土
Dialogue: 0,0:39:11.87,0:39:14.16,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,比用黏土制作法更简单
Dialogue: 0,0:39:14.75,0:39:16.70,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,也比铁更轻更耐用
Dialogue: 0,0:39:16.91,0:39:18.58,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是种无毒害的物质
Dialogue: 0,0:39:20.25,0:39:23.54,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好吧 我放弃进行工程
Dialogue: 0,0:39:24.00,0:39:24.66,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,技安
Dialogue: 0,0:39:25.25,0:39:26.25,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你好棒
Dialogue: 0,0:39:27.33,0:39:30.41,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,谢谢两位愿意为这个星球着想
Dialogue: 0,0:39:40.04,0:39:41.16,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,拿出精神来啊
Dialogue: 0,0:39:42.00,0:39:43.20,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,一点都不像你
Dialogue: 0,0:39:43.87,0:39:46.83,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,别管我 我失去活下去的目标了
Dialogue: 0,0:39:47.50,0:39:51.33,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那我们来举办技安的独唱会\N热闹一下吧
Dialogue: 0,0:39:51.37,0:39:52.66,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不行
Dialogue: 0,0:39:55.08,0:39:57.25,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,还好 他好像没听到
Dialogue: 0,0:39:57.91,0:40:00.54,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,对了 我们帮他找回恐龙吧
Dialogue: 0,0:40:01.25,0:40:02.25,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好
Dialogue: 0,0:40:02.75,0:40:05.25,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,对了 我都忘记了
Dialogue: 0,0:40:05.66,0:40:07.54,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,各位 快点出发
Dialogue: 0,0:40:08.20,0:40:09.83,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,还好 他心情变好了
Dialogue: 0,0:40:10.08,0:40:11.37,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是精力旺盛
Dialogue: 0,0:40:13.83,0:40:19.37,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,小恐龙 小恐龙
Dialogue: 0,0:40:19.87,0:40:26.33,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,小恐龙...
Dialogue: 0,0:40:26.75,0:40:30.70,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好像有其它玩偶到过森林里面了
Dialogue: 0,0:40:34.33,0:40:36.87,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,小恐龙...
Dialogue: 0,0:40:37.04,0:40:39.08,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,它会不会不想出来了
Dialogue: 0,0:40:39.37,0:40:40.33,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你这话是什么意思?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:40.83,0:40:44.08,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我是它最重要的人
Dialogue: 0,0:40:45.37,0:40:46.33,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这我倒不知道
Dialogue: 0,0:40:50.20,0:40:52.41,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,小恐龙...
Dialogue: 0,0:40:53.00,0:40:56.25,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,怎么找都没找到\N它到底上哪去了?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:59.04,0:41:00.50,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,算了 我放弃
Dialogue: 0,0:41:01.33,0:41:05.50,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我带了这个来\N我们坐太空船到宇宙去找吧
Dialogue: 0,0:41:06.25,0:41:08.58,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,用那种玩具怎么可能找到?
Dialogue: 0,0:41:09.41,0:41:09.83,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这哪是玩具
Dialogue: 0,0:41:10.33,0:41:13.04,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我给它上过发条 真的可以发动
Dialogue: 0,0:41:13.50,0:41:14.50,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,如果到宇宙上空去找
Dialogue: 0,0:41:14.75,0:41:16.16,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我想一定很快就能找到
Dialogue: 0,0:41:16.83,0:41:18.41,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,小叮当 放大灯
Dialogue: 0,0:41:18.70,0:41:19.58,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,没问题
Dialogue: 0,0:41:36.87,0:41:37.83,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好大
Dialogue: 0,0:41:39.37,0:41:41.04,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,马上出发吧
Dialogue: 0,0:41:41.50,0:41:43.37,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,等一下 先别急
Dialogue: 0,0:41:44.00,0:41:48.33,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这可是一场大冒险\N最好带点水和粮食去
Dialogue: 0,0:41:48.70,0:41:49.58,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你说得对
Dialogue: 0,0:41:50.00,0:41:52.50,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,太好了 技安 你总算有精神了
Dialogue: 0,0:41:52.75,0:41:53.41,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,嗯
Dialogue: 0,0:41:54.16,0:41:55.83,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,明天早上来做准备
Dialogue: 0,0:41:56.20,0:41:57.08,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好啊
Dialogue: 0,0:42:08.16,0:42:11.33,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,终于到了 大金块的湖
Dialogue: 0,0:42:11.58,0:42:12.41,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,只要过了今夜
Dialogue: 0,0:42:12.66,0:42:15.33,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们就成了亿万富翁了
Dialogue: 0,0:42:17.83,0:42:19.83,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,先派个人去观察地形
Dialogue: 0,0:42:20.50,0:42:24.70,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,黑痣 黑痣 黑痣...
Dialogue: 0,0:42:25.16,0:42:26.33,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,老是叫我黑痣
Dialogue: 0,0:42:26.75,0:42:31.04,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,人家明明叫做熊虎鬼五郎
Dialogue: 0,0:42:31.41,0:42:33.50,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,至少让我尿尿先吧
Dialogue: 0,0:42:34.75,0:42:37.54,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他打算怎么搬大金块呢?
Dialogue: 0,0:42:49.08,0:42:56.25,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,啊... 啊...
Dialogue: 0,0:42:57.33,0:42:58.37,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,社长
Dialogue: 0,0:43:00.00,0:43:01.66,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你到哪去了? 黑痣
Dialogue: 0,0:43:02.16,0:43:04.16,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,有只巨大的怪兽
Dialogue: 0,0:43:04.41,0:43:06.20,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你是不是睡糊涂了?
Dialogue: 0,0:43:06.41,0:43:07.58,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是真的
Dialogue: 0,0:43:08.16,0:43:09.33,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,别说那些了
Dialogue: 0,0:43:09.58,0:43:11.75,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,快点去调查一下湖底的情况
Dialogue: 0,0:43:12.00,0:43:14.20,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,社长 我只是你的分身
Dialogue: 0,0:43:14.50,0:43:16.00,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你是知道我不会游泳的啊
Dialogue: 0,0:43:17.00,0:43:19.83,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,有氧气桶 别担心
Dialogue: 0,0:43:47.66,0:43:49.37,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,下面的情况如何?
Dialogue: 0,0:43:49.83,0:43:52.66,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,眼珠 有眼珠
Dialogue: 0,0:43:53.08,0:43:55.33,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,眼珠 那是什么?
Dialogue: 0,0:44:04.83,0:44:07.00,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这是怎么回事?
Dialogue: 0,0:45:00.58,0:45:02.33,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是大断层
Dialogue: 0,0:45:31.00,0:45:32.83,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,快点爬到岩石山上去
Dialogue: 0,0:45:33.41,0:45:34.16,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,还要爬啊
Dialogue: 0,0:45:34.37,0:45:36.33,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,社长这里有个洞
Dialogue: 0,0:45:36.75,0:45:38.87,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好 先躲起来再说
Dialogue: 0,0:45:43.16,0:45:44.37,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,黑痣 快点
Dialogue: 0,0:45:45.54,0:45:46.25,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,进去
Dialogue: 0,0:45:50.08,0:45:51.04,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那么大的怪物
Dialogue: 0,0:45:51.33,0:45:52.91,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是没有办法进来这里的
Dialogue: 0,0:45:59.25,0:46:00.83,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,果然进不来
Dialogue: 0,0:46:09.50,0:46:10.33,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,它来了
Dialogue: 0,0:46:10.70,0:46:11.37,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,快点到里面去
Dialogue: 0,0:46:11.70,0:46:12.70,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,快点跑啊
Dialogue: 0,0:46:19.04,0:46:20.54,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,快追上了
Dialogue: 0,0:46:29.58,0:46:30.75,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是出口
Dialogue: 0,0:46:54.25,0:46:57.04,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,等等 它没追来了
Dialogue: 0,0:46:59.00,0:47:01.50,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,没想到它这么快就故弃了
Dialogue: 0,0:47:02.00,0:47:06.50,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,社长 我们回地球去吧\N这种星球我已经受够了
Dialogue: 0,0:47:06.83,0:47:09.41,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,胆小鬼 这样还算是我的分身吗?
Dialogue: 0,0:47:10.00,0:47:10.91,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,可是...
Dialogue: 0,0:47:12.83,0:47:14.33,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你们看
Dialogue: 0,0:47:15.50,0:47:19.50,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那里居然有火箭\N一定是那些小孩子的
Dialogue: 0,0:47:19.87,0:47:24.54,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,怎么能不好好利用\N那只蓝色狸猫呢?
Dialogue: 0,0:47:30.75,0:47:35.54,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,坐火箭找小恐龙时\N顺便探查这个星球的秘密吧
Dialogue: 0,0:47:35.60,0:47:38.05,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,阿福 你带这么多东西啊
Dialogue: 0,0:47:38.25,0:47:40.00,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我怕有什么万一
Dialogue: 0,0:47:40.16,0:47:43.83,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,所以就把所有遥控车\N都上了发条带来了
Dialogue: 0,0:47:44.16,0:47:44.87,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,万一?
Dialogue: 0,0:47:45.33,0:47:48.50,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,冒险常会有的事啊 对吧 技安
Dialogue: 0,0:47:49.66,0:47:50.50,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你怎么了?
Dialogue: 0,0:47:51.00,0:47:53.25,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,刚才我看到森林里面有黑影
Dialogue: 0,0:47:53.70,0:47:57.37,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,森林里面有很多玩偶的
Dialogue: 0,0:47:57.75,0:48:00.37,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不怎么有那么大的玩偶
Dialogue: 0,0:48:03.70,0:48:05.58,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是小恐龙
Dialogue: 0,0:48:07.87,0:48:11.83,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,小恐龙...
Dialogue: 0,0:48:13.04,0:48:17.70,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,真的是你啊 我好担心\N你上哪去了?
Dialogue: 0,0:48:20.50,0:48:21.83,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,迷路了吧
Dialogue: 0,0:48:22.20,0:48:26.20,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你跟我一样个性都那么的内向
Dialogue: 0,0:48:27.33,0:48:29.00,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,变得好大啊
Dialogue: 0,0:48:29.87,0:48:30.91,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,快点抓住它吧
Dialogue: 0,0:48:31.37,0:48:34.25,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,小恐龙性格很像我 它是很温柔的
Dialogue: 0,0:48:34.58,0:48:35.37,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是吗?
Dialogue: 0,0:48:35.83,0:48:36.70,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是我的弟弟
Dialogue: 0,0:48:36.91,0:48:37.83,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,弟弟?
Dialogue: 0,0:48:38.33,0:48:41.33,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们等一下要在这个星球上探险
Dialogue: 0,0:48:41.66,0:48:42.87,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你要不要一起去?
Dialogue: 0,0:48:44.83,0:48:46.91,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是吗? 你喜欢森林啊
Dialogue: 0,0:48:48.00,0:48:48.83,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,太好了
Dialogue: 0,0:48:49.20,0:48:52.50,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这么大怎么进去火箭里面
Dialogue: 0,0:48:52.83,0:48:55.50,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,虽然分手 让我很难过
Dialogue: 0,0:48:55.66,0:48:56.50,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但只要你幸福就好
Dialogue: 0,0:48:56.66,0:48:57.91,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好好的活下去吧
Dialogue: 0,0:48:58.83,0:49:00.16,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,真夸张
Dialogue: 0,0:49:00.58,0:49:04.00,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,再见了 小恐龙
Dialogue: 0,0:49:14.00,0:49:14.66,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,技安
Dialogue: 0,0:49:15.16,0:49:17.54,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好吧 阿福 我们出发了
Dialogue: 0,0:49:17.83,0:49:18.41,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好的
Dialogue: 0,0:49:22.37,0:49:23.66,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,把行李拿上去吧
Dialogue: 0,0:49:25.66,0:49:26.25,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是谁?
Dialogue: 0,0:49:28.37,0:49:30.83,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这火箭现在属于我的了
Dialogue: 0,0:49:31.00,0:49:33.66,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你们最好乖乖的听我的话
Dialogue: 0,0:49:34.33,0:49:37.50,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这么恶心的玩偶是谁带来的
Dialogue: 0,0:49:38.00,0:49:39.00,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不是 这不是我的玩偶
Dialogue: 0,0:49:39.08,0:49:41.50,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,说了你们一定会大吃一惊
Dialogue: 0,0:49:41.87,0:49:45.20,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我就是前科累累的...
Dialogue: 0,0:49:45.50,0:49:46.41,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,全痴累累?
Dialogue: 0,0:49:46.83,0:49:52.08,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不是 是前科累累的熊虎鬼五郎
Dialogue: 0,0:49:52.33,0:49:53.16,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,鬼五郎?
Dialogue: 0,0:49:53.66,0:49:56.91,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,就是电视播报的...逃狱的犯人?
Dialogue: 0,0:49:57.16,0:49:58.25,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,快逃啊
Dialogue: 0,0:49:58.58,0:49:59.66,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,别跑
Dialogue: 0,0:50:00.37,0:50:01.04,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这边
Dialogue: 0,0:50:01.87,0:50:02.66,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,别跑
Dialogue: 0,0:50:04.00,0:50:05.25,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,有好多个鬼五郎
Dialogue: 0,0:50:06.00,0:50:07.83,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,蓝色狸猫 投降吧
Dialogue: 0,0:50:08.04,0:50:11.54,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你休想得逞 竹蜻蜓
Dialogue: 0,0:50:15.37,0:50:17.00,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,飞走了
Dialogue: 0,0:50:17.41,0:50:20.50,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,糟糕 他们居然会飞 快点去追啊
Dialogue: 0,0:50:21.16,0:50:23.58,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,为什么会有那么多鬼五郎
Dialogue: 0,0:50:23.91,0:50:26.04,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,可能是利用复制镜吧
Dialogue: 0,0:50:26.75,0:50:29.66,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但他为何会到这个星球来?
Dialogue: 0,0:50:30.00,0:50:32.16,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们好像常常得跑啊
Dialogue: 0,0:50:33.33,0:50:34.87,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,小叮当 怎么办好呢?
Dialogue: 0,0:50:35.16,0:50:37.33,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,如果不把他们从这个星球上赶走
Dialogue: 0,0:50:37.50,0:50:40.00,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,发条城市一定会被他破坏
Dialogue: 0,0:50:40.41,0:50:42.08,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,把他们引离市中心远一点
Dialogue: 0,0:50:42.33,0:50:43.00,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好
Dialogue: 0,0:50:44.08,0:50:45.58,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他们往岩石山方向飞去了
Dialogue: 0,0:50:46.25,0:50:46.91,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,又来了
Dialogue: 0,0:50:46.91,0:50:47.08,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是岩石山\N又来了
Dialogue: 0,0:50:47.08,0:50:48.00,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是岩石山
Dialogue: 0,0:50:52.83,0:50:53.70,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,小叮当...
Dialogue: 0,0:50:55.00,0:50:57.00,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你怎么了?
Dialogue: 0,0:50:59.25,0:50:59.83,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我快...
Dialogue: 0,0:51:03.25,0:51:04.75,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大雄你没事吧?
Dialogue: 0,0:51:05.20,0:51:07.08,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,还有没有可以替换?
Dialogue: 0,0:51:07.41,0:51:08.08,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,没有了
Dialogue: 0,0:51:08.83,0:51:10.04,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,槽糕 快撞到岩石山了
Dialogue: 0,0:51:21.33,0:51:22.00,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,社长
Dialogue: 0,0:51:22.20,0:51:24.16,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,万一那个金块怪物又出现
Dialogue: 0,0:51:24.33,0:51:25.16,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那我们该怎么办?
Dialogue: 0,0:51:25.91,0:51:28.37,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那群孩子可以对付的
Dialogue: 0,0:51:28.66,0:51:30.83,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,所以就算用强硬的手段\N也要他们听我的
Dialogue: 0,0:51:31.04,0:51:33.33,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,别在这里说废话 快点去追
Dialogue: 0,0:51:33.50,0:51:34.20,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是
Dialogue: 0,0:51:34.83,0:51:35.75,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,别跟丢了
Dialogue: 0,0:51:37.50,0:51:40.08,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我也没电了 我也是
Dialogue: 0,0:51:45.00,0:51:46.50,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,刚才真是好危险
Dialogue: 0,0:51:47.08,0:51:49.41,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,如果掉到大断层 那就铁定没命了
Dialogue: 0,0:51:49.70,0:51:52.00,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他们不会追到这里来了吧
Dialogue: 0,0:51:52.87,0:51:55.16,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,上面架了个梯子
Dialogue: 0,0:51:55.50,0:51:57.00,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是谁架的呢
Dialogue: 0,0:51:57.25,0:51:59.00,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好可怕啊
Dialogue: 0,0:52:00.91,0:52:01.70,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,在那边
Dialogue: 0,0:52:02.58,0:52:03.54,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,追来了
Dialogue: 0,0:52:04.04,0:52:05.66,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,只有这条路可以走
Dialogue: 0,0:52:07.66,0:52:10.08,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,社长 他们要过梯子了
Dialogue: 0,0:52:10.54,0:52:12.08,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,在那之前把他们给抓住
Dialogue: 0,0:52:12.50,0:52:13.20,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是
Dialogue: 0,0:52:14.00,0:52:15.25,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,技安 快点
Dialogue: 0,0:52:15.66,0:52:16.70,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,别推我
Dialogue: 0,0:52:16.75,0:52:17.58,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,快一点
Dialogue: 0,0:52:25.37,0:52:27.58,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,等一下 我的裙子
Dialogue: 0,0:52:28.58,0:52:30.50,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,裙子给卡住了
Dialogue: 0,0:52:31.00,0:52:32.91,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,宜静 你别动
Dialogue: 0,0:52:33.33,0:52:34.83,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 大雄\N- 大雄
Dialogue: 0,0:52:35.25,0:52:37.00,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我马上来救你
Dialogue: 0,0:52:37.75,0:52:38.70,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大雄
Dialogue: 0,0:52:39.04,0:52:39.75,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,没事的
Dialogue: 0,0:52:42.87,0:52:44.41,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,宜静...
Dialogue: 0,0:52:44.70,0:52:45.50,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大雄...
Dialogue: 0,0:52:49.25,0:52:52.75,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大雄他...为了要救我
Dialogue: 0,0:52:53.08,0:52:54.16,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,怎么会?
Dialogue: 0,0:52:55.70,0:52:57.33,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大雄
Dialogue: 0,0:52:58.20,0:53:00.91,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大雄 你真是个好人
Dialogue: 0,0:53:03.20,0:53:06.20,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,小鬼们 快点乖乖的投降
Dialogue: 0,0:53:06.58,0:53:08.00,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,混帐 放开宜静
Dialogue: 0,0:53:14.37,0:53:15.00,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,跟我走
Dialogue: 0,0:53:16.33,0:53:18.00,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,放开我 大雄...
Dialogue: 0,0:53:18.25,0:53:19.50,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不然会被他给杀死的
Dialogue: 0,0:53:19.91,0:53:20.91,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,宜静
Dialogue: 0,0:53:22.00,0:53:23.08,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,放开她
Dialogue: 0,0:53:23.41,0:53:24.75,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他是谁啊?
Dialogue: 0,0:53:25.33,0:53:26.08,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,它来了
Dialogue: 0,0:53:31.50,0:53:32.91,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是黄金大魔神
Dialogue: 0,0:53:33.16,0:53:34.00,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,快逃阿
Dialogue: 0,0:53:39.58,0:53:41.33,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不得了了 大雄...
Dialogue: 0,0:53:43.66,0:53:44.41,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,等等我
Dialogue: 0,0:53:46.66,0:53:48.33,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,小叮当 有没有什么道具
Dialogue: 0,0:53:48.66,0:53:49.37,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,可以帮我们逃命
Dialogue: 0,0:53:49.66,0:53:50.50,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我想想
Dialogue: 0,0:53:52.70,0:53:54.91,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不是这个 也不是那个
Dialogue: 0,0:53:56.37,0:53:57.16,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,找到了
Dialogue: 0,0:53:57.66,0:54:00.37,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,人类客车转换器
Dialogue: 0,0:54:00.87,0:54:03.37,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,熊五郎先生 快点把烟囱放在头上
Dialogue: 0,0:54:03.66,0:54:04.75,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我叫做鬼五郎
Dialogue: 0,0:54:05.16,0:54:06.37,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这就是客车啊?
Dialogue: 0,0:54:06.54,0:54:08.83,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,对 吃一个炭糖
Dialogue: 0,0:54:11.41,0:54:13.08,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,然后喝水
Dialogue: 0,0:54:25.58,0:54:26.87,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,各位坐好了吗?
Dialogue: 0,0:54:27.33,0:54:28.16,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,快点
Dialogue: 0,0:54:28.50,0:54:29.20,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,开车
Dialogue: 0,0:54:44.00,0:54:45.00,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,黑痣
Dialogue: 0,0:54:46.37,0:54:47.25,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,别逃
Dialogue: 0,0:55:24.87,0:55:26.87,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,它应该不会追到这里吧
Dialogue: 0,0:55:27.50,0:55:30.25,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不行 我们得把它击败
Dialogue: 0,0:55:30.50,0:55:32.25,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,蓝色狸猫有没有什么武器
Dialogue: 0,0:55:32.83,0:55:34.08,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我才没那种东西
Dialogue: 0,0:55:34.58,0:55:38.54,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,而且我不是狸猫\N而是猫形状的机器人
Dialogue: 0,0:55:45.33,0:55:47.54,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,社长 他们有这个耶
Dialogue: 0,0:55:48.66,0:55:50.66,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那是我的遥控汽车
Dialogue: 0,0:55:50.91,0:55:53.70,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,笨蛋 这种玩具能干什么?
Dialogue: 0,0:55:55.20,0:55:56.83,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好像是可以用哦
Dialogue: 0,0:55:57.08,0:55:59.04,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我记得你有个奇妙的手电筒
Dialogue: 0,0:55:59.41,0:56:00.66,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那个借用一下
Dialogue: 0,0:56:01.33,0:56:03.20,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你要干什么? 放手
Dialogue: 0,0:56:06.66,0:56:08.50,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我不是叫你放手了吗?
Dialogue: 0,0:56:21.41,0:56:24.33,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,社长 好像有东西\N从岩石山那里飞过来
Dialogue: 0,0:56:24.83,0:56:26.00,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,如果坐视不理的话
Dialogue: 0,0:56:26.20,0:56:27.37,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你们创造出来的都市
Dialogue: 0,0:56:27.58,0:56:28.66,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,也会很危险的
Dialogue: 0,0:56:29.33,0:56:30.75,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,小叮当 快想想办法
Dialogue: 0,0:56:32.50,0:56:34.87,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,社长 是黄金独角仙
Dialogue: 0,0:56:35.41,0:56:36.91,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,黄金独角仙?
Dialogue: 0,0:56:37.41,0:56:38.33,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不是魔神啊?
Dialogue: 0,0:56:38.66,0:56:41.50,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,它可以任意的变幻自己的外形
Dialogue: 0,0:56:46.66,0:56:47.75,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,它过来了
Dialogue: 0,0:56:48.00,0:56:49.33,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,火箭会被它毁掉
Dialogue: 0,0:56:49.70,0:56:50.33,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,跟它拼了吧
Dialogue: 0,0:56:50.66,0:56:54.58,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好放大灯
Dialogue: 0,0:57:06.20,0:57:07.20,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,攻击吧
Dialogue: 0,0:57:07.50,0:57:08.04,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好
Dialogue: 0,0:57:16.37,0:57:17.66,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,技安 帮我的忙
Dialogue: 0,0:57:18.00,0:57:19.54,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好 交给我
Dialogue: 0,0:57:22.83,0:57:23.66,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,发射
Dialogue: 0,0:57:27.70,0:57:30.00,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,为什么它不反击呢?
Dialogue: 0,0:57:34.83,0:57:37.08,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,成功了 你们挺行的嘛
Dialogue: 0,0:57:37.54,0:57:39.08,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这方面我还有点自信
Dialogue: 0,0:57:44.16,0:57:46.33,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,碎成小块了
Dialogue: 0,0:57:46.66,0:57:48.83,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那就比较方便搬运多了
Dialogue: 0,0:57:49.16,0:57:51.54,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,原来那个怪物只是外强中虚
Dialogue: 0,0:57:56.00,0:57:57.58,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那些金块怎么...
Dialogue: 0,0:58:07.58,0:58:09.50,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,又要变身了
Dialogue: 0,0:58:17.50,0:58:19.08,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那是什么?
Dialogue: 0,0:58:27.00,0:58:28.91,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,危险 快点逃
Dialogue: 0,0:58:29.33,0:58:31.08,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,怎么能这么快就认输
Dialogue: 0,0:58:32.54,0:58:34.16,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,快点逃到里面去
Dialogue: 0,0:58:39.33,0:58:41.33,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我的遥控车
Dialogue: 0,0:58:41.91,0:58:43.50,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,阿福 会被压扁的
Dialogue: 0,0:58:44.20,0:58:45.00,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,遥控车...
Dialogue: 0,0:58:48.04,0:58:49.37,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,快进来火箭里面
Dialogue: 0,0:58:59.41,0:59:02.16,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,到底那一个是发射按钮?
Dialogue: 0,0:59:15.50,0:59:17.16,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,发射出去了
Dialogue: 0,0:59:24.41,0:59:26.33,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,它一定没办法追来了
Dialogue: 0,0:59:26.50,0:59:27.83,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不愧是社长
Dialogue: 0,0:59:28.41,0:59:30.25,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你闯了大祸了
Dialogue: 0,0:59:30.58,0:59:32.20,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这火箭只不过是玩具啊...
Dialogue: 0,0:59:32.41,0:59:35.70,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这么多人坐在上面\N燃料一下子就会用完了
Dialogue: 0,0:59:45.54,0:59:45.91,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那么 现在就开始
Dialogue: 0,0:59:46.25,0:59:50.00,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,羊迪生博士的发明发表会
Dialogue: 0,0:59:50.87,0:59:56.54,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这就是我发明的空气清净机
Dialogue: 0,0:59:57.16,0:59:58.83,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这部清净机能让我们
Dialogue: 0,0:59:59.04,1:00:02.00,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,拥有跟森林树木赖以生存的空气
Dialogue: 0,1:00:02.41,1:00:06.87,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,保持一定程度的清洁
Dialogue: 0,1:00:09.83,1:00:12.58,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那么 请博士拉动祝贺的彩球
Dialogue: 0,1:00:22.83,1:00:25.66,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,小猴子 你干嘛恶作剧
Dialogue: 0,1:00:26.33,1:00:28.25,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,快点下来 小猴子
Dialogue: 0,1:00:30.20,1:00:31.16,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你是谁?
Dialogue: 0,1:00:42.66,1:00:46.33,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,小猴子\N你不能随便帮玩具上发条的
Dialogue: 0,1:00:47.25,1:00:49.70,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那可不是拿来玩的
Dialogue: 0,1:00:51.66,1:00:54.41,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,把它们送回原来的地方
Dialogue: 0,1:00:58.20,1:01:00.50,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他们好可怜峨
Dialogue: 0,1:01:01.16,1:01:01.87,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,没办法
Dialogue: 0,1:01:02.25,1:01:04.33,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,就准许他们住在这里吧
Dialogue: 0,1:01:07.83,1:01:10.83,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不过 那个发条是很重要的
Dialogue: 0,1:01:11.08,1:01:13.41,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,立刻还给小叮当先生
Dialogue: 0,1:01:23.20,1:01:26.58,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,启动啊 这部坏机器
Dialogue: 0,1:01:27.00,1:01:28.16,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,才不是坏机器呢
Dialogue: 0,1:01:28.66,1:01:30.25,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那你快点想办法啊
Dialogue: 0,1:01:30.66,1:01:33.16,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是你擅自将它发射的
Dialogue: 0,1:01:33.66,1:01:35.41,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你这只蓝色狸猫居然这么凶
Dialogue: 0,1:01:35.70,1:01:37.37,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我说过我不是狸猫
Dialogue: 0,1:01:37.66,1:01:38.87,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这家伙
Dialogue: 0,1:01:42.75,1:01:43.54,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,宜静
Dialogue: 0,1:01:45.41,1:01:46.70,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大雄他...
Dialogue: 0,1:01:51.00,1:01:54.25,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大雄 你一定要平安无事
Dialogue: 0,1:02:10.83,1:02:12.00,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不好意思
Dialogue: 0,1:02:12.16,1:02:14.16,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我要到5楼的玩具销售部
Dialogue: 0,1:02:14.75,1:02:15.70,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,真是不巧
Dialogue: 0,1:02:16.00,1:02:18.00,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这部电梯正要开往地下室去
Dialogue: 0,1:02:18.33,1:02:20.41,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那请让我出去
Dialogue: 0,1:02:20.83,1:02:22.08,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那可不行
Dialogue: 0,1:02:23.58,1:02:24.50,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,让我出去
Dialogue: 0,1:02:25.00,1:02:27.50,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,既然你那么想出去\N那我就让你出去吧
Dialogue: 0,1:02:28.16,1:02:31.20,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,啊...
Dialogue: 0,1:02:41.08,1:02:44.54,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,跑啊
Dialogue: 0,1:02:45.66,1:02:47.50,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大雄
Dialogue: 0,1:02:49.70,1:02:54.04,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,等一下 你好过份\N居然丢下我就跑掉了
Dialogue: 0,1:02:54.50,1:02:55.50,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,对不起
Dialogue: 0,1:02:57.33,1:03:00.50,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,咳...好多的废气
Dialogue: 0,1:03:00.91,1:03:01.83,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,就是啊
Dialogue: 0,1:03:03.04,1:03:05.41,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,救命啊快来救我
Dialogue: 0,1:03:05.54,1:03:13.08,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,快来救我 哈哈...
Dialogue: 0,1:03:15.33,1:03:17.50,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是谁 敢向我挑战
Dialogue: 0,1:03:18.50,1:03:20.58,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我是神枪手大雄
Dialogue: 0,1:03:21.50,1:03:23.75,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,真是嚣张的小鬼
Dialogue: 0,1:03:28.87,1:03:30.50,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哈哈哈 怎么能让你抢走
Dialogue: 0,1:03:30.83,1:03:32.37,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我那么美丽的女孩呢?
Dialogue: 0,1:03:32.83,1:03:34.33,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,神枪手大雄
Dialogue: 0,1:03:34.87,1:03:36.83,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,由于神枪手获得胜利
Dialogue: 0,1:03:37.83,1:03:41.75,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,因而保佑了发条都市的和平
Dialogue: 0,1:03:45.58,1:03:47.70,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,宜静 你怎么了?
Dialogue: 0,1:03:48.41,1:03:53.08,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,抢歉 我刚才跑进你内心里
Dialogue: 0,1:03:53.37,1:03:54.37,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我的内心?
Dialogue: 0,1:03:54.75,1:03:58.16,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,对 真正的你在后面
Dialogue: 0,1:03:59.50,1:04:01.25,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我死掉了啊...
Dialogue: 0,1:04:01.91,1:04:03.70,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不 你只是晕过去了
Dialogue: 0,1:04:04.16,1:04:06.58,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你又是谁?
Dialogue: 0,1:04:06.58,1:04:08.25,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我是播种人
Dialogue: 0,1:04:08.66,1:04:10.08,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这个星球的造物主
Dialogue: 0,1:04:10.50,1:04:13.66,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,造物主?  就是神啊
Dialogue: 0,1:04:14.08,1:04:15.25,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不太一样
Dialogue: 0,1:04:16.66,1:04:18.54,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,原来神是这样子的啊
Dialogue: 0,1:04:19.00,1:04:21.50,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们其实没有真正的模样
Dialogue: 0,1:04:22.16,1:04:24.66,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,只是为了让人类更容易了解
Dialogue: 0,1:04:24.83,1:04:26.50,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,所以才会变换外形
Dialogue: 0,1:04:27.00,1:04:29.00,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你找我有什么事?
Dialogue: 0,1:04:29.54,1:04:31.75,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我希望你能听听我的心声
Dialogue: 0,1:04:32.08,1:04:34.16,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你还是先让我出去吧
Dialogue: 0,1:04:34.33,1:04:35.66,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不然他们会很担心的
Dialogue: 0,1:04:36.08,1:04:38.16,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我要说的是很重要的事
Dialogue: 0,1:04:40.83,1:04:45.33,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,要如何从这么高的陀螺\N回到地面上呢?
Dialogue: 0,1:04:45.66,1:04:48.04,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这不是陀螺 是我的太空站
Dialogue: 0,1:04:48.50,1:04:50.25,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这可是很棒的设计
Dialogue: 0,1:04:51.00,1:04:53.25,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,而且这也不是回到地面上的道具
Dialogue: 0,1:04:53.70,1:04:55.83,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这个里面有很多装置
Dialogue: 0,1:04:56.16,1:04:59.87,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们最好边调查地面情况\N再一边想对策
Dialogue: 0,1:05:00.16,1:05:02.16,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不管你如何 快点给我想办法
Dialogue: 0,1:05:02.50,1:05:03.08,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,什么嘛
Dialogue: 0,1:05:03.75,1:05:06.41,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,说那种不负责任的话
Dialogue: 0,1:05:06.75,1:05:09.33,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,技安 跟他吵也没用
Dialogue: 0,1:05:09.54,1:05:11.16,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,现在我们在同一条船上
Dialogue: 0,1:05:11.83,1:05:12.70,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,真是的
Dialogue: 0,1:05:13.08,1:05:15.50,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我去看看监视器
Dialogue: 0,1:05:17.66,1:05:20.75,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那头怪物到底哪去了?
Dialogue: 0,1:05:21.00,1:05:21.70,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,鬼五郎先生
Dialogue: 0,1:05:22.66,1:05:24.66,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,有没有找到大雄?
Dialogue: 0,1:05:25.41,1:05:27.00,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,掉到大断层里的孩子啊
Dialogue: 0,1:05:27.87,1:05:29.50,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,像怪物那么大的物体还可以看到
Dialogue: 0,1:05:29.70,1:05:31.20,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但他那么小这种监视器是找不到的
Dialogue: 0,1:05:31.83,1:05:34.25,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大雄是为了救我才...
Dialogue: 0,1:05:35.16,1:05:36.33,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他不会有事的
Dialogue: 0,1:05:36.66,1:05:38.50,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这个星球有着奇妙的力量
Dialogue: 0,1:05:38.91,1:05:40.00,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,所以他一定还活着
Dialogue: 0,1:05:41.50,1:05:45.04,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,叔叔你跟其他鬼五郎不一样\N你人真好
Dialogue: 0,1:05:45.50,1:05:46.75,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,就是啊
Dialogue: 0,1:05:47.33,1:05:49.54,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,黑痣 给我好好的监视
Dialogue: 0,1:05:49.54,1:05:50.75,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是的
Dialogue: 0,1:05:51.83,1:05:53.54,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,都一样是复制人啊
Dialogue: 0,1:05:55.00,1:05:59.20,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,播种? 为什么要播种呢?
Dialogue: 0,1:05:59.58,1:06:01.20,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,在大约30亿年前
Dialogue: 0,1:06:01.66,1:06:04.25,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,分别在火星跟地球\N散播了生物的种子
Dialogue: 0,1:06:04.83,1:06:05.87,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是有机物质
Dialogue: 0,1:06:06.41,1:06:08.16,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但是火星上却失败了
Dialogue: 0,1:06:09.00,1:06:11.00,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好不容易有生命萌芽
Dialogue: 0,1:06:11.41,1:06:14.16,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,却因为小行星的猛烈撞击\N使一切又化为乌有
Dialogue: 0,1:06:15.50,1:06:17.50,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,另一方面你们所住的地球
Dialogue: 0,1:06:18.25,1:06:21.00,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,被栽培成宇宙中\N闪烁的一个绿洲地带
Dialogue: 0,1:06:21.41,1:06:22.83,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,地球也将要失败了吗?
Dialogue: 0,1:06:23.33,1:06:26.75,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,结果还不知道\N发看将来人类的努力了
Dialogue: 0,1:06:27.08,1:06:31.00,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,难道说 梅星上的植物\N也是你播种的吗?
Dialogue: 0,1:06:31.50,1:06:36.00,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,没错 我本来想把这个星球\N当作植物的乐园
Dialogue: 0,1:06:36.75,1:06:39.08,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好不容易有了今天的成果
Dialogue: 0,1:06:39.50,1:06:42.37,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这时候你们却毁了\N这个星球的保护层闯了进来
Dialogue: 0,1:06:43.58,1:06:45.83,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那是小叮当在拍卖会上\N得到的安慰奖品
Dialogue: 0,1:06:46.33,1:06:50.00,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这我知道 其实是你念错了号码
Dialogue: 0,1:06:50.70,1:06:52.08,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,怎么会 这是最后一张
Dialogue: 0,1:06:52.33,1:06:54.20,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,没办法了 等一下我再想办法
Dialogue: 0,1:06:54.41,1:06:56.50,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,SSS-BC-555
Dialogue: 0,1:06:57.16,1:06:58.66,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,什么?  是333才对
Dialogue: 0,1:06:58.87,1:07:01.04,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,没错,是333才对
Dialogue: 0,1:07:01.54,1:07:04.25,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,居然会把3跟5搞错了
Dialogue: 0,1:07:04.54,1:07:05.33,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,天啊
Dialogue: 0,1:07:05.70,1:07:08.25,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不过来的人还好是你们
Dialogue: 0,1:07:08.87,1:07:11.83,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,刚开始的暴风雨\N是我借给植物们力量
Dialogue: 0,1:07:12.16,1:07:13.50,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,想藉机赶走你们
Dialogue: 0,1:07:13.91,1:07:16.50,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那场暴风雨是你主使的啊
Dialogue: 0,1:07:16.50,1:07:17.08,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是的
Dialogue: 0,1:07:17.08,1:07:20.16,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那么 救了我一命的这些花草\N也是你...
Dialogue: 0,1:07:20.54,1:07:22.58,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不 那是植物们的意识
Dialogue: 0,1:07:23.00,1:07:23.75,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,意识?
Dialogue: 0,1:07:24.37,1:07:27.87,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这个星球的植物\N可以借行动表现出想法
Dialogue: 0,1:07:28.25,1:07:32.04,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,表示这个星球上的植物\N愿意接受你们
Dialogue: 0,1:07:32.25,1:07:34.33,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那我的使命也结束了
Dialogue: 0,1:07:35.16,1:07:40.33,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我可以放心的把这个星球\N交给爱护大自然的你们了
Dialogue: 0,1:07:40.50,1:07:42.54,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,交给我们?
Dialogue: 0,1:07:43.00,1:07:46.75,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我要走了 到下一个星球去播种
Dialogue: 0,1:07:47.37,1:07:49.41,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那些坏人怎么办?
Dialogue: 0,1:07:50.25,1:07:53.33,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,用你们的力量去解决
Dialogue: 0,1:07:53.70,1:07:55.16,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这是一个锻炼的机会
Dialogue: 0,1:07:55.75,1:07:56.83,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,什么?
Dialogue: 0,1:07:57.50,1:08:01.54,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,只要大家同心协力\N一定能够克服的
Dialogue: 0,1:08:02.83,1:08:05.33,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,等一下
Dialogue: 0,1:08:20.50,1:08:21.33,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,怎么了?
Dialogue: 0,1:08:21.83,1:08:24.33,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是那个黄金大怪物\N它从地面上飞了起来
Dialogue: 0,1:08:24.83,1:08:27.54,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那马上就会追到这里了
Dialogue: 0,1:08:27.54,1:08:27.70,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,社长 要怎么办好啊?\N那马上就会追到这里了
Dialogue: 0,1:08:27.70,1:08:29.00,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,社长 要怎么办好啊?
Dialogue: 0,1:08:29.54,1:08:31.08,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,到底是怎么一回事?
Dialogue: 0,1:08:31.50,1:08:32.83,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,方向不同啊
Dialogue: 0,1:08:37.66,1:08:38.75,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,飞过去了
Dialogue: 0,1:08:41.50,1:08:44.00,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,看来那家伙己经放弃\N所以便离开这个星球
Dialogue: 0,1:08:44.58,1:08:46.04,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,太好了
Dialogue: 0,1:08:46.83,1:08:48.50,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这么一来\N这个星球上己经没有什么好怕的了
Dialogue: 0,1:08:48.91,1:08:51.33,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,只剩下那只蓝色猫咪
Dialogue: 0,1:08:51.91,1:08:54.70,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,叮当猫咪\N你已经想到回地面的方法了吗?
Dialogue: 0,1:08:55.16,1:08:57.00,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我不是叮当猫咪 我叫小叮当
Dialogue: 0,1:08:57.33,1:08:59.66,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,其实我们也很想回去啊
Dialogue: 0,1:09:00.50,1:09:01.33,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我知道
Dialogue: 0,1:09:02.83,1:09:05.83,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,方法是有啦 可是很危险
Dialogue: 0,1:09:06.08,1:09:06.66,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,什么方法?
Dialogue: 0,1:09:07.04,1:09:10.04,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,想办法在火箭的后面产生爆作
Dialogue: 0,1:09:10.33,1:09:13.04,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,因为这个冲击力量\N火箭便会往前进
Dialogue: 0,1:09:13.37,1:09:16.20,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,再来只要靠星球上的引力\N就能着陆了
Dialogue: 0,1:09:16.54,1:09:18.70,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,原来如此 很简单阿
Dialogue: 0,1:09:19.54,1:09:22.54,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,只要将这个太空站引爆就行了
Dialogue: 0,1:09:23.66,1:09:25.75,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这可是我的太空站啊
Dialogue: 0,1:09:26.16,1:09:26.91,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,啰嗦
Dialogue: 0,1:09:27.58,1:09:29.25,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们不是有定时炸药吗?
Dialogue: 0,1:09:30.50,1:09:33.00,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,对 从工程现场偷来的
Dialogue: 0,1:09:33.50,1:09:36.75,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,别说偷 说“借”知道吗?
Dialogue: 0,1:09:36.91,1:09:38.50,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,很好 去准备吧
Dialogue: 0,1:09:39.37,1:09:43.50,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,小叮当...
Dialogue: 0,1:09:44.33,1:09:46.08,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好 自己爬上去
Dialogue: 0,1:09:51.83,1:09:54.04,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,得快点告诉大家
Dialogue: 0,1:10:07.50,1:10:09.65,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,要送我上去啊?
Dialogue: 0,1:10:13.70,1:10:16.75,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,得救了 谢谢你啊 叶子们
Dialogue: 0,1:10:17.25,1:10:18.75,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,先去找他们再说
Dialogue: 0,1:10:19.37,1:10:23.75,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,小叮当 宜静 阿福 技安
Dialogue: 0,1:10:28.04,1:10:30.54,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你怎么不遵守诺言
Dialogue: 0,1:10:31.04,1:10:35.66,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,诺言?  我答应过你们什么吗?
Dialogue: 0,1:10:36.00,1:10:37.16,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大骗子
Dialogue: 0,1:10:37.41,1:10:39.54,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,快给我松绑
Dialogue: 0,1:10:39.83,1:10:42.00,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,抱歉 是社长的命令
Dialogue: 0,1:10:42.54,1:10:45.58,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大雄可能会来救你们的
Dialogue: 0,1:10:46.04,1:10:48.16,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这么一来 那个星球就是我的了
Dialogue: 0,1:10:49.04,1:10:51.08,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,节省了很多时间跟力气\N轻松的就把你们干掉
Dialogue: 0,1:10:51.66,1:10:53.41,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,社长 准备好了
Dialogue: 0,1:10:53.83,1:10:55.66,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,5分钟后就会爆炸
Dialogue: 0,1:10:56.33,1:10:57.41,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,快点到火箭上面去吧
Dialogue: 0,1:11:02.50,1:11:03.75,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,祝福你们了
Dialogue: 0,1:11:04.33,1:11:06.25,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,放开我
Dialogue: 0,1:11:14.08,1:11:16.50,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,各位 抓紧了
Dialogue: 0,1:11:16.83,1:11:17.54,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是
Dialogue: 0,1:11:18.16,1:11:19.08,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,妈妈
Dialogue: 0,1:11:21.83,1:11:25.37,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,都是我不好 让他绑住了
Dialogue: 0,1:11:30.37,1:11:32.54,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,绳子 绳子松掉了
Dialogue: 0,1:11:33.00,1:11:34.50,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,太好了 快点
Dialogue: 0,1:11:35.50,1:11:37.25,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,多亏黑痣先生的帮忙
Dialogue: 0,1:11:37.50,1:11:38.20,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,太好了
Dialogue: 0,1:11:40.91,1:11:42.20,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我去制止它曝作
Dialogue: 0,1:11:42.37,1:11:43.58,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,技安 别碰 很危险
Dialogue: 0,1:11:44.83,1:11:46.33,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,没时间了 快点到外面去
Dialogue: 0,1:11:46.66,1:11:49.25,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,穿透圈跟适应灯
Dialogue: 0,1:11:49.83,1:11:53.00,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,出了外面\N就马上藏在其他的行星后面
Dialogue: 0,1:11:53.25,1:11:53.91,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,知道了吗?
Dialogue: 0,1:12:00.58,1:12:03.33,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,小叮当他 小叮当...
Dialogue: 0,1:12:03.70,1:12:05.20,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,小叮当他怎么了?
Dialogue: 0,1:12:09.04,1:12:10.16,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他说要制止炸药爆炸
Dialogue: 0,1:12:10.37,1:12:11.50,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,所以还在里面没出来
Dialogue: 0,1:12:12.91,1:12:14.25,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,会不会有事?
Dialogue: 0,1:12:18.70,1:12:21.16,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不行 要爆炸了
Dialogue: 0,1:12:37.50,1:12:39.70,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,根据森林里植物们的意见
Dialogue: 0,1:12:40.25,1:12:44.50,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,它们希望能参加本星球的\N未来计划委员会
Dialogue: 0,1:12:45.33,1:12:46.87,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,当然欢迎
Dialogue: 0,1:12:47.25,1:12:49.33,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,像我们以前所住的地球
Dialogue: 0,1:12:49.54,1:12:52.70,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,因为忽视植物们的意见\N而造成大洪水
Dialogue: 0,1:12:53.00,1:12:56.66,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,人类似乎也开始注意到这一点了
Dialogue: 0,1:12:56.91,1:13:01.37,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,总之 要定居在这个星球上\N就得刻不容缓的与植物们进行对话
Dialogue: 0,1:13:03.16,1:13:04.25,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那是什么?
Dialogue: 0,1:13:09.08,1:13:10.00,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是火箭
Dialogue: 0,1:13:10.25,1:13:11.08,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,为什么会这样?
Dialogue: 0,1:13:12.08,1:13:13.33,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,真是太过份了
Dialogue: 0,1:13:13.87,1:13:17.54,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,驾驶技术太差劲了
Dialogue: 0,1:13:22.33,1:13:25.33,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这应该是小叮当先生的吧
Dialogue: 0,1:13:25.58,1:13:27.66,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,真是差点把玩偶们吓死
Dialogue: 0,1:13:27.87,1:13:28.87,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,去抗议吧
Dialogue: 0,1:13:30.87,1:13:33.41,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,小叮当先生 这样做太过份了吧
Dialogue: 0,1:13:33.91,1:13:35.66,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,请把门打开
Dialogue: 0,1:13:38.54,1:13:40.04,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不是小叮当先生
Dialogue: 0,1:13:40.25,1:13:41.91,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,耶...哈哈...
Dialogue: 0,1:13:42.33,1:13:43.66,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好像安全降落了
Dialogue: 0,1:13:43.91,1:13:49.00,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,还有可爱的玩偶们来迎接\N实在太令人高兴了
Dialogue: 0,1:13:50.00,1:13:53.41,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大家到底上哪去了?
Dialogue: 0,1:13:54.00,1:13:56.66,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,小叮当 我好饿
Dialogue: 0,1:13:58.83,1:14:02.37,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这里不是停放火箭的地点吗?
Dialogue: 0,1:14:03.54,1:14:07.04,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这么说 他们都到太空里去了啊
Dialogue: 0,1:14:07.66,1:14:09.33,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,怎么会这样
Dialogue: 0,1:14:10.16,1:14:14.08,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,飞到那么远 我没办法了
Dialogue: 0,1:14:16.20,1:14:18.50,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,原来是宜静的小象
Dialogue: 0,1:14:18.70,1:14:19.54,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你别吓我啊
Dialogue: 0,1:14:20.33,1:14:23.87,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,唉? 你要背我啊 谢谢
Dialogue: 0,1:14:25.00,1:14:26.16,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,真是帮了我大忙
Dialogue: 0,1:14:26.41,1:14:27.75,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我已经累坏了
Dialogue: 0,1:14:31.87,1:14:35.16,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,如果能到镇上去\N应该就会有办法的
Dialogue: 0,1:14:46.83,1:14:48.00,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这是怎么回事?
Dialogue: 0,1:14:53.25,1:14:55.54,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,为什么鬼五郎的复制人\N会在那里监视四周呢?
Dialogue: 0,1:14:55.83,1:14:57.33,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大雄先生 是谁?
Dialogue: 0,1:14:58.00,1:15:00.00,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,镇上发生严重的事情了
Dialogue: 0,1:15:00.75,1:15:02.70,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,什么? 被占领?
Dialogue: 0,1:15:03.16,1:15:05.33,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,突然一架火箭从天而降
Dialogue: 0,1:15:09.50,1:15:17.00,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这个星球现在是我们的\N违抗者格杀勿论
Dialogue: 0,1:15:18.54,1:15:20.25,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,镇上被弄得乱七八槽的
Dialogue: 0,1:15:20.75,1:15:23.50,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你独自一只小猪\N居然也能逃了出来
Dialogue: 0,1:15:24.08,1:15:27.08,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不过到处都是他的手下\N我根本无法回去
Dialogue: 0,1:15:27.33,1:15:29.25,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,小叮当他们没在火箭上吗?
Dialogue: 0,1:15:29.66,1:15:30.25,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,没有
Dialogue: 0,1:15:30.87,1:15:32.41,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,如果有他在就好了
Dialogue: 0,1:15:33.00,1:15:34.00,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他们到底上哪去了?
Dialogue: 0,1:15:34.54,1:15:35.16,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好痛
Dialogue: 0,1:15:35.58,1:15:36.54,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是生命发条
Dialogue: 0,1:15:39.58,1:15:40.83,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你是宜静的玩偶
Dialogue: 0,1:15:43.00,1:15:44.50,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,它是来把发条还给你们的
Dialogue: 0,1:15:46.25,1:15:47.37,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这是什么?
Dialogue: 0,1:15:48.16,1:15:50.25,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,小猴子不知道从哪里带来的
Dialogue: 0,1:15:51.91,1:15:53.66,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不知道从哪带来的?
Dialogue: 0,1:15:54.16,1:15:56.66,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你利用任意门回去地球上啊
Dialogue: 0,1:15:58.20,1:15:58.91,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这么说
Dialogue: 0,1:15:59.58,1:16:02.16,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,对了 备用袋
Dialogue: 0,1:16:02.83,1:16:04.54,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我回地球一趟
Dialogue: 0,1:16:05.33,1:16:05.58,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,等一下
Dialogue: 0,1:16:07.16,1:16:09.00,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你去太危险了
Dialogue: 0,1:16:09.66,1:16:10.16,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,为什么?
Dialogue: 0,1:16:10.75,1:16:12.54,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,到处是那坏人的手下
Dialogue: 0,1:16:12.83,1:16:14.16,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,小猴子去比较好
Dialogue: 0,1:16:15.16,1:16:15.83,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,小猴子?
Dialogue: 0,1:16:16.50,1:16:18.33,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,它去的话不会被注意到
Dialogue: 0,1:16:18.50,1:16:20.00,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,况且这种事它很在行的
Dialogue: 0,1:16:20.37,1:16:22.33,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好 那就拜托你了
Dialogue: 0,1:16:24.83,1:16:26.66,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,看好 是这种形状的东西
Dialogue: 0,1:16:27.50,1:16:30.00,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,门一打开就是我的房间
Dialogue: 0,1:16:30.50,1:16:32.50,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你把门后的衣柜打开
Dialogue: 0,1:16:33.25,1:16:36.00,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那只小猪跑到哪里去了?
Dialogue: 0,1:16:41.00,1:16:42.50,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哎...
Dialogue: 0,1:16:48.54,1:16:50.66,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,能不能顺利的拿来呢?
Dialogue: 0,1:16:51.16,1:16:51.91,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,可以的
Dialogue: 0,1:16:57.70,1:17:00.16,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那些孩子们不知道怎么了
Dialogue: 0,1:17:00.91,1:17:03.33,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,社长这样做太过份了
Dialogue: 0,1:17:08.75,1:17:11.08,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,咦? 这里有那个东西啊
Dialogue: 0,1:17:11.75,1:17:13.16,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,真令人怀念
Dialogue: 0,1:17:13.41,1:17:15.04,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我小时候一直好想坐的
Dialogue: 0,1:17:18.00,1:17:19.20,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,应该可以坐吧
Dialogue: 0,1:17:20.00,1:17:20.54,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,真好
Dialogue: 0,1:17:20.83,1:17:21.70,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好舒服
Dialogue: 0,1:17:22.83,1:17:24.25,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这里
Dialogue: 0,1:17:35.75,1:17:36.75,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,袋子
Dialogue: 0,1:17:41.83,1:17:44.50,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,小猴子到底知不知道什么是衣柜
Dialogue: 0,1:17:44.91,1:17:46.50,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,别担心 一定没有问题的
Dialogue: 0,1:17:49.50,1:17:52.20,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,只要有了那个口袋\N就能见到他们了
Dialogue: 0,1:17:52.83,1:17:53.70,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,怎么见?
Dialogue: 0,1:18:00.33,1:18:01.04,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,等你好久了
Dialogue: 0,1:18:01.20,1:18:02.20,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你能平安回来真是太好了
Dialogue: 0,1:18:02.75,1:18:03.70,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那包袱里是什么?
Dialogue: 0,1:18:07.66,1:18:09.25,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这是我的内裤啊
Dialogue: 0,1:18:10.50,1:18:13.58,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这是帽子 虽然形状都一样
Dialogue: 0,1:18:14.08,1:18:16.58,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,有了 备用袋
Dialogue: 0,1:18:17.20,1:18:20.33,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这个袋子跟小叮当的口袋\N是相通的
Dialogue: 0,1:18:20.70,1:18:22.50,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,只要进到这里面...
Dialogue: 0,1:18:23.08,1:18:25.25,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,万一他们在宇宙里面 适应灯
Dialogue: 0,1:18:27.04,1:18:28.25,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这是以防万一
Dialogue: 0,1:18:33.58,1:18:34.83,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,小叮当...
Dialogue: 0,1:18:35.16,1:18:40.25,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,小叮当 快点张开眼睛
Dialogue: 0,1:18:41.37,1:18:43.50,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你死了我们该怎么办
Dialogue: 0,1:18:44.16,1:18:45.33,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,要我们死在这种地方啊
Dialogue: 0,1:18:45.66,1:18:46.83,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,妈妈
Dialogue: 0,1:18:47.58,1:18:49.00,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,小叮当...
Dialogue: 0,1:19:00.75,1:19:02.54,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他醒了 小叮当
Dialogue: 0,1:19:04.25,1:19:06.00,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,虽然醒了 可是好像坏了
Dialogue: 0,1:19:09.00,1:19:12.50,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,有人在我的口袋里面
Dialogue: 0,1:19:14.00,1:19:14.83,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,有人?
Dialogue: 0,1:19:15.08,1:19:15.50,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是谁?
Dialogue: 0,1:19:17.66,1:19:18.50,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是我啊
Dialogue: 0,1:19:19.08,1:19:20.83,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是大雄啊
Dialogue: 0,1:19:21.25,1:19:22.70,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大雄 太好了
Dialogue: 0,1:19:23.66,1:19:25.50,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你还活着啊
Dialogue: 0,1:19:27.04,1:19:31.50,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,对了 我们可以回到备用袋里啊
Dialogue: 0,1:19:31.75,1:19:33.91,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,为什么不早点想到呢
Dialogue: 0,1:19:34.87,1:19:36.83,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,小叮当 快点回发条都市去
Dialogue: 0,1:19:37.70,1:19:38.16,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,没问题
Dialogue: 0,1:19:39.33,1:19:40.91,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大家快跳到我的口袋里
Dialogue: 0,1:19:41.66,1:19:43.83,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,阿福 等待一下
Dialogue: 0,1:19:44.70,1:19:47.33,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不要乱摸 赶快走
Dialogue: 0,1:19:49.54,1:19:50.41,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,快点
Dialogue: 0,1:19:51.00,1:19:54.33,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大家都回去了 再来就剩下我了
Dialogue: 0,1:19:57.75,1:19:58.87,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,让你们久等了
Dialogue: 0,1:19:59.37,1:20:02.66,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,太好了 大家都没事了
Dialogue: 0,1:20:03.04,1:20:06.16,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,发条都市\N已经被鬼五郎他们给占领了
Dialogue: 0,1:20:06.83,1:20:09.04,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,什么? 是真的吗?
Dialogue: 0,1:20:12.87,1:20:15.20,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,个个都那么没用
Dialogue: 0,1:20:15.91,1:20:18.83,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,鬼五郎怎么会因为这样就昏倒呢?
Dialogue: 0,1:20:19.16,1:20:21.33,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我真的看到骷髅骷颅头
Dialogue: 0,1:20:21.54,1:20:23.54,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,熊猫从后面打我啊
Dialogue: 0,1:20:24.20,1:20:24.91,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,算了
Dialogue: 0,1:20:25.33,1:20:26.66,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,黑痣你留在这里监视他们
Dialogue: 0,1:20:27.00,1:20:29.54,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,知道了吗?  是
Dialogue: 0,1:20:30.00,1:20:32.75,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我绝对不允许你们\N把这个星球上的木头拿去卖
Dialogue: 0,1:20:33.00,1:20:34.54,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,或是盖旅馆饭店之类
Dialogue: 0,1:20:35.25,1:20:36.91,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我也是这么认为
Dialogue: 0,1:20:42.75,1:20:44.08,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,果然没错
Dialogue: 0,1:20:44.50,1:20:46.50,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他把任意门拿走了
Dialogue: 0,1:20:47.00,1:20:49.00,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,什么声音
Dialogue: 0,1:20:53.20,1:20:54.83,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是牛因斯坦跟羊迪生
Dialogue: 0,1:20:55.04,1:20:56.00,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你们都没事啊
Dialogue: 0,1:21:01.50,1:21:06.66,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们曾努力想保护家园\N但最终还是输了
Dialogue: 0,1:21:07.33,1:21:11.00,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们能想到的武器只有这个
Dialogue: 0,1:21:11.25,1:21:13.70,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,就让我把他们打个落花流水吧
Dialogue: 0,1:21:14.00,1:21:18.04,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,技安不可能的 他们都有手枪啊
Dialogue: 0,1:21:18.58,1:21:20.75,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不过还好大家都没事
Dialogue: 0,1:21:21.66,1:21:24.16,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我哥哥呢?
Dialogue: 0,1:21:24.41,1:21:28.75,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他为了救我们\N自己又跑回去当诱饵
Dialogue: 0,1:21:29.16,1:21:30.41,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,结果被他们给抓了
Dialogue: 0,1:21:30.70,1:21:32.58,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,什么?
Dialogue: 0,1:21:33.33,1:21:34.20,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,快点去救它吧
Dialogue: 0,1:21:34.83,1:21:36.08,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好
Dialogue: 0,1:21:36.75,1:21:38.41,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,小叮当 有没有什么好办法
Dialogue: 0,1:21:40.33,1:21:41.20,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,有啊
Dialogue: 0,1:21:42.04,1:21:42.83,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,什么办法?
Dialogue: 0,1:21:43.25,1:21:47.41,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,鬼五郎以为我们死了
Dialogue: 0,1:21:47.75,1:21:50.66,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,如果需要我们帮忙就请直说
Dialogue: 0,1:21:51.00,1:21:53.75,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这个计划我们几个人去就够了
Dialogue: 0,1:21:54.00,1:21:57.16,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们一定把它救出来\N你们在这里等着
Dialogue: 0,1:21:57.58,1:21:59.25,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,石头帽子
Dialogue: 0,1:21:59.83,1:22:03.00,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,戴上这项帽子 就会类似隐形了
Dialogue: 0,1:22:03.16,1:22:06.16,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,没有人会发现的 快戴上吧
Dialogue: 0,1:22:07.33,1:22:08.66,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不见了
Dialogue: 0,1:22:08.83,1:22:10.58,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这发明真是伟大
Dialogue: 0,1:22:11.16,1:22:12.54,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你们在那里啊
Dialogue: 0,1:22:12.66,1:22:13.75,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,就在你旁边
Dialogue: 0,1:22:13.91,1:22:17.16,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,各位 照我们刚才说的\N马上到市公所去
Dialogue: 0,1:22:18.87,1:22:19.54,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,出发了
Dialogue: 0,1:22:24.66,1:22:29.33,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,社长 我觉得还是\N把那些玩具给破坏掉比较好
Dialogue: 0,1:22:29.54,1:22:33.83,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,笨蛋 用用你的脑\N它们可以我们忙的
Dialogue: 0,1:22:34.16,1:22:35.08,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,原来如此
Dialogue: 0,1:22:35.41,1:22:39.33,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,况且又有了这扇门\N这里已经成了我们的天下了
Dialogue: 0,1:22:39.58,1:22:41.83,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不愧是社长 脑子真聪明
Dialogue: 0,1:22:51.41,1:22:53.54,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你们打算怎么做?
Dialogue: 0,1:22:54.00,1:22:56.00,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我也不知道
Dialogue: 0,1:22:56.25,1:22:58.91,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,小叮当他们\N一定不会允许你们这么做的
Dialogue: 0,1:22:59.58,1:23:02.33,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他们 他们真是可怜
Dialogue: 0,1:23:02.83,1:23:03.66,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,怎么了?
Dialogue: 0,1:23:04.33,1:23:05.91,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,都死掉了
Dialogue: 0,1:23:05.91,1:23:07.41,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,都死掉了?  你骗我的吧?
Dialogue: 0,1:23:07.83,1:23:11.04,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这都是实话 大雄掉到大断层下面
Dialogue: 0,1:23:11.33,1:23:12.83,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,其他四个人...
Dialogue: 0,1:23:13.66,1:23:14.58,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,宜静小姐呢?
Dialogue: 0,1:23:15.91,1:23:16.75,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,停电啊
Dialogue: 0,1:23:17.25,1:23:18.50,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是有人关掉开关吧
Dialogue: 0,1:23:19.20,1:23:20.70,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我去看看
Dialogue: 0,1:23:22.54,1:23:30.75,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,真是寂寞 居然丢下我们不管
Dialogue: 0,1:23:31.54,1:23:32.37,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,有鬼
Dialogue: 0,1:23:33.00,1:23:35.83,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不是我的错 是社长啊
Dialogue: 0,1:23:38.33,1:23:39.50,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,滚吧
Dialogue: 0,1:23:42.66,1:23:44.83,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你们果然还活着
Dialogue: 0,1:23:45.41,1:23:46.50,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,皮姆 我们来救你了
Dialogue: 0,1:23:47.25,1:23:48.00,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,宜静小姐
Dialogue: 0,1:23:48.66,1:23:51.08,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,社长 有鬼啊
Dialogue: 0,1:23:51.41,1:23:53.04,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那些小孩的幽灵出现了
Dialogue: 0,1:23:53.54,1:23:57.58,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,什么?  世界上哪里有幽灵
Dialogue: 0,1:23:58.16,1:24:04.00,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,难道他们活着回来了\N快点抓住他们
Dialogue: 0,1:24:04.41,1:24:07.91,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,糟糕 他好像发现了\N我们快点逃吧
Dialogue: 0,1:24:08.20,1:24:08.87,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好
Dialogue: 0,1:24:09.33,1:24:10.87,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,乌云瓦斯
Dialogue: 0,1:24:11.33,1:24:14.33,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,只要躲进这个乌云里\N就会变成隐身
Dialogue: 0,1:24:14.58,1:24:15.83,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,让敌人看不到我们
Dialogue: 0,1:24:16.25,1:24:17.16,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我要喷了
Dialogue: 0,1:24:19.50,1:24:21.58,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 我进来了\N- 眼睛好难过啊
Dialogue: 0,1:24:23.16,1:24:26.00,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大家一起跟着乌云跑
Dialogue: 0,1:24:27.00,1:24:29.50,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,槽糕 小猪被救走了
Dialogue: 0,1:24:29.87,1:24:31.33,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,社长 有个锁头在跑
Dialogue: 0,1:24:32.08,1:24:33.04,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,什么?
Dialogue: 0,1:24:35.70,1:24:37.75,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他们一定又用了什么道具
Dialogue: 0,1:24:38.00,1:24:39.58,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,快点锁定锁头为目标
Dialogue: 0,1:24:44.50,1:24:45.75,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,快点逃到森林里
Dialogue: 0,1:24:50.54,1:24:52.54,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,糟糕 乌云散掉了
Dialogue: 0,1:24:52.83,1:24:54.20,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,终于露出你们的真面目了
Dialogue: 0,1:24:54.75,1:24:57.33,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,快点抓住他们 别让他们跑了
Dialogue: 0,1:25:06.50,1:25:07.91,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,躲到哪里去了?
Dialogue: 0,1:25:08.33,1:25:09.83,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,跑到这里就突然不见了
Dialogue: 0,1:25:10.37,1:25:12.00,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,应该还没跑远
Dialogue: 0,1:25:12.66,1:25:15.66,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大家分头仔细给我找是
Dialogue: 0,1:25:19.50,1:25:22.75,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,叮当猫 快点出来 你们跑不掉了
Dialogue: 0,1:25:23.58,1:25:25.54,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,只有跟他们拼一拼了
Dialogue: 0,1:25:25.87,1:25:27.70,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,小叮当 你没有武器吗?
Dialogue: 0,1:25:28.08,1:25:31.50,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,在树林里面 是不能用空气枪的
Dialogue: 0,1:25:32.16,1:25:33.41,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,飘飘枪
Dialogue: 0,1:25:33.83,1:25:36.83,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这是梦想魔幻乐园的那支枪吗?
Dialogue: 0,1:25:37.16,1:25:39.83,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是啊 是赠送的纪念品
Dialogue: 0,1:25:40.66,1:25:41.83,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那是枪吗?
Dialogue: 0,1:25:42.16,1:25:43.16,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这个啊
Dialogue: 0,1:25:43.50,1:25:44.91,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,社长
Dialogue: 0,1:25:45.70,1:25:46.58,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,怎么了?
Dialogue: 0,1:25:46.83,1:25:47.50,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他们跑了吗?
Dialogue: 0,1:25:51.00,1:25:52.20,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,小恐龙
Dialogue: 0,1:25:56.66,1:25:57.54,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,开枪打它
Dialogue: 0,1:25:59.54,1:26:00.25,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,子弹没有了
Dialogue: 0,1:26:00.50,1:26:01.91,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我也是 我也是
Dialogue: 0,1:26:03.75,1:26:05.50,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,混蛋 去死吧
Dialogue: 0,1:26:14.33,1:26:15.50,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他们要跑了
Dialogue: 0,1:26:15.83,1:26:16.37,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好
Dialogue: 0,1:26:20.04,1:26:21.66,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,怎么了没事吧
Dialogue: 0,1:26:22.25,1:26:24.50,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,身体突然浮了起来
Dialogue: 0,1:26:25.04,1:26:26.00,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,救命啊
Dialogue: 0,1:26:26.83,1:26:28.25,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不错啊 大雄
Dialogue: 0,1:26:28.70,1:26:31.16,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,怎样 我的射击技术不错吧
Dialogue: 0,1:26:31.41,1:26:32.70,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,太棒了
Dialogue: 0,1:26:33.08,1:26:36.00,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,快点抬着他们两个\N通通逃到森林里面去
Dialogue: 0,1:26:36.50,1:26:38.00,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你们给我记住
Dialogue: 0,1:26:40.16,1:26:42.25,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,成功了
Dialogue: 0,1:26:44.83,1:26:45.33,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,小恐龙
Dialogue: 0,1:26:45.87,1:26:47.33,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,小恐龙 谢谢你
Dialogue: 0,1:26:47.66,1:26:49.00,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你特地来救我们啊
Dialogue: 0,1:26:49.66,1:26:51.20,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我的小恐龙真厉害
Dialogue: 0,1:26:51.75,1:26:53.50,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不愧是技安的弟弟
Dialogue: 0,1:26:55.54,1:26:58.20,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,叫玩偶们一起回镇上去吧
Dialogue: 0,1:26:58.58,1:26:59.41,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好
Dialogue: 0,1:27:04.66,1:27:05.33,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,各位
Dialogue: 0,1:27:05.58,1:27:07.41,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,因为小叮当他们的帮忙
Dialogue: 0,1:27:07.75,1:27:09.58,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们又重新夺回发条都市
Dialogue: 0,1:27:10.00,1:27:11.58,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但并不表示从此就安全了
Dialogue: 0,1:27:12.41,1:27:17.70,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,鬼五郎他们远躲在森林里\N我们不能只是逃避
Dialogue: 0,1:27:18.16,1:27:19.37,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,只要我们同心协力
Dialogue: 0,1:27:19.66,1:27:21.41,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,就算武器很小也要跟他们打
Dialogue: 0,1:27:21.91,1:27:25.91,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们必须用自己的双手\N来保护这个星球
Dialogue: 0,1:27:26.66,1:27:28.50,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大家一定 要坚持到最后
Dialogue: 0,1:27:31.33,1:27:33.75,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,播种使者在离开的时候也曾说过
Dialogue: 0,1:27:34.25,1:27:39.08,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,要靠你们的力量来解决\N这点你应该知道的
Dialogue: 0,1:27:39.50,1:27:41.20,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,谁是播种使者?
Dialogue: 0,1:27:41.66,1:27:44.50,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我掉到大断层时 所遇到的神仙
Dialogue: 0,1:27:45.20,1:27:46.16,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,神仙?
Dialogue: 0,1:27:46.66,1:27:48.58,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是个闪耀金黄色光芒的少年
Dialogue: 0,1:27:48.87,1:27:52.16,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不 他不停变幻外形\N时而变成大魔神
Dialogue: 0,1:27:52.75,1:27:55.54,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,原来他是个神仙
Dialogue: 0,1:27:56.00,1:27:58.16,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他叫做播种使者啊
Dialogue: 0,1:27:58.41,1:28:01.58,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,嗯 他说他曾经在火星跟地球上\N播下了生命的种子
Dialogue: 0,1:28:02.08,1:28:05.50,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但火星因为小行星的撞击
Dialogue: 0,1:28:05.70,1:28:07.37,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,因而没有生命延续
Dialogue: 0,1:28:08.25,1:28:09.20,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这个事情我听说过
Dialogue: 0,1:28:09.50,1:28:13.04,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,从火星落到地球上的陨石\N据说有生命的痕迹
Dialogue: 0,1:28:13.70,1:28:16.66,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,播种使者在这个星球上\N播下了种子
Dialogue: 0,1:28:17.04,1:28:18.50,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,原来来如此啊
Dialogue: 0,1:28:20.00,1:28:22.75,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们也有责任保卫这个星球
Dialogue: 0,1:28:23.16,1:28:24.83,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,没错 你说的对
Dialogue: 0,1:28:25.16,1:28:28.83,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好 我们要抓住鬼五郎\N把他带回地球上去
Dialogue: 0,1:28:29.66,1:28:32.66,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,各位 小猴子有情报汇报
Dialogue: 0,1:28:33.25,1:28:37.50,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,鬼五郎他们明天一早\N就要进行总攻击
Dialogue: 0,1:28:39.16,1:28:43.00,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好 我们今晚好好休息\N明天准备应战
Dialogue: 0,1:28:43.25,1:28:43.87,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,等等
Dialogue: 0,1:28:44.33,1:28:45.70,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,在那之前
Dialogue: 0,1:28:46.66,1:28:47.54,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,干什么?
Dialogue: 0,1:28:48.66,1:28:50.08,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,要先吃点东西啊
Dialogue: 0,1:28:50.50,1:28:52.25,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哎呀呀...
Dialogue: 0,1:29:05.16,1:29:07.50,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不知道鬼五郎他们会从哪里攻进来
Dialogue: 0,1:29:07.91,1:29:09.58,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,要顾好自己的岗位
Dialogue: 0,1:29:10.08,1:29:11.91,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大雄这一班负责蛋蛋屋
Dialogue: 0,1:29:12.25,1:29:14.75,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,技安 阿福这一班负责商店街
Dialogue: 0,1:29:15.25,1:29:17.83,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,皮姆这一班负责中央
Dialogue: 0,1:29:18.16,1:29:20.50,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,有任何状况都要马上通知我
Dialogue: 0,1:29:21.00,1:29:22.00,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是
Dialogue: 0,1:29:26.20,1:29:26.91,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,听好了
Dialogue: 0,1:29:27.16,1:29:28.83,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,虽然对手是小孩跟玩偶
Dialogue: 0,1:29:29.00,1:29:30.33,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但绝对不能再饶过他们了
Dialogue: 0,1:29:30.66,1:29:32.33,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,一个个的把他们解决掉
Dialogue: 0,1:29:32.50,1:29:34.00,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,任何活口也不准留
Dialogue: 0,1:29:34.20,1:29:35.54,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是
Dialogue: 0,1:30:02.04,1:30:04.83,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,来了 他们兵分多路
Dialogue: 0,1:30:05.04,1:30:07.25,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,技安和阿福 你那有4个人
Dialogue: 0,1:30:07.66,1:30:09.91,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,技安 好像有4个人\N往我们这边来了
Dialogue: 0,1:30:10.20,1:30:12.00,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,4个人啊 绝不能放过他们
Dialogue: 0,1:30:15.00,1:30:16.04,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大家上
Dialogue: 0,1:30:18.70,1:30:21.08,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,原来躲在这里啊 这些家伙
Dialogue: 0,1:30:22.16,1:30:25.04,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是骷髅 教命啊
Dialogue: 0,1:30:26.66,1:30:27.66,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,各位加油
Dialogue: 0,1:30:28.66,1:30:33.20,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,鬼五郎 看招 抓住他们
Dialogue: 0,1:30:38.20,1:30:39.66,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,成功了
Dialogue: 0,1:30:40.00,1:30:42.00,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大雄 你那里也有4个
Dialogue: 0,1:30:42.66,1:30:43.33,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,了解
Dialogue: 0,1:30:45.83,1:30:46.83,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,站住
Dialogue: 0,1:30:47.04,1:30:47.70,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,被发现了
Dialogue: 0,1:30:48.83,1:30:50.16,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你们没事吧
Dialogue: 0,1:30:56.33,1:30:57.50,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,把枪给我
Dialogue: 0,1:31:04.33,1:31:07.41,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,正面有5个人 皮姆我们准备上了
Dialogue: 0,1:31:07.58,1:31:09.16,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大家冲啊
Dialogue: 0,1:31:21.33,1:31:24.00,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,社长 他们人那么多\N我们打不赢的
Dialogue: 0,1:31:24.33,1:31:26.75,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,谁说的 快点把他们给杀了
Dialogue: 0,1:31:40.04,1:31:41.75,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,黑痣先生 你怎么也在里面
Dialogue: 0,1:31:42.25,1:31:45.50,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,有什么办法\N我也是鬼五郎的分身啊
Dialogue: 0,1:31:46.16,1:31:49.50,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,混帐 一个个都没用 用最后一招
Dialogue: 0,1:31:50.08,1:31:52.66,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,成功了
Dialogue: 0,1:31:54.75,1:31:55.91,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,小叮当 森林着火了
Dialogue: 0,1:32:05.91,1:32:07.83,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,怎么这么过份
Dialogue: 0,1:32:09.83,1:32:12.37,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,叮当猫咪 如果你不想让火势越大
Dialogue: 0,1:32:12.66,1:32:14.16,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,就马上向我投降
Dialogue: 0,1:32:14.87,1:32:16.16,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,小叮当 想想办法啊
Dialogue: 0,1:32:16.70,1:32:19.87,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这样下去森林跟镇上\N都会化为灰烬的
Dialogue: 0,1:32:20.70,1:32:23.33,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,对了 放大灯
Dialogue: 0,1:32:37.33,1:32:37.54,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,太好了
Dialogue: 0,1:32:38.58,1:32:39.54,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不愧是小叮当
Dialogue: 0,1:32:49.00,1:32:51.00,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,槽糕 鬼五郎逃走了
Dialogue: 0,1:32:51.33,1:32:53.04,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 我去追\N- 大雄
Dialogue: 0,1:32:57.50,1:32:58.70,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他跑到哪里去了?
Dialogue: 0,1:32:59.87,1:33:02.04,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是小木马 小木马
Dialogue: 0,1:33:02.87,1:33:04.37,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,鬼五郎往哪里...
Dialogue: 0,1:33:06.20,1:33:08.16,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他往这里啊 谢谢你
Dialogue: 0,1:33:08.83,1:33:11.04,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,没想到他们\N比我想像的要难对付
Dialogue: 0,1:33:11.70,1:33:12.33,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,唔?
Dialogue: 0,1:33:13.04,1:33:13.87,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,等一下
Dialogue: 0,1:33:15.16,1:33:17.04,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不知天高地厚的小鬼
Dialogue: 0,1:33:21.58,1:33:22.25,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,躲起来
Dialogue: 0,1:33:24.20,1:33:27.00,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,小鬼 出来跟我一决胜负吧
Dialogue: 0,1:33:30.00,1:33:32.50,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,躲起来也没用
Dialogue: 0,1:33:33.70,1:33:34.37,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,没错
Dialogue: 0,1:33:35.16,1:33:36.33,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那是什么?
Dialogue: 0,1:33:40.83,1:33:42.37,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那个小鬼到底躲在哪里?
Dialogue: 0,1:33:44.58,1:33:48.00,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,森林里的植物们 挺身出来救我
Dialogue: 0,1:33:49.00,1:33:50.83,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,鬼五郎
Dialogue: 0,1:33:51.16,1:33:51.91,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,小鬼
Dialogue: 0,1:34:03.50,1:34:04.33,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,成功了
Dialogue: 0,1:34:07.83,1:34:12.33,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好可怕 救我啊\N我不会再做坏事了
Dialogue: 0,1:34:13.04,1:34:15.16,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大雄 你真是神枪手
Dialogue: 0,1:34:15.50,1:34:17.16,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哪有的事
Dialogue: 0,1:34:18.54,1:34:20.50,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,实在感谢各位
Dialogue: 0,1:34:21.37,1:34:25.83,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不过这些复制人\N又不能带回地球上去
Dialogue: 0,1:34:27.50,1:34:31.66,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,所以要用复制蛋清理器\N把他们都清理掉
Dialogue: 0,1:34:53.75,1:34:56.50,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,应该只剩下一个人而已
Dialogue: 0,1:35:05.87,1:35:09.16,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我觉得自己好像重新活过来
Dialogue: 0,1:35:10.00,1:35:13.50,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,给大家添了麻烦 对不起
Dialogue: 0,1:35:14.50,1:35:15.87,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你变成本体啦
Dialogue: 0,1:35:17.25,1:35:20.25,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我要回去地球上自首
Dialogue: 0,1:35:20.54,1:35:21.16,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,黑痣先生
Dialogue: 0,1:35:21.50,1:35:23.58,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,任意门
Dialogue: 0,1:35:25.37,1:35:28.00,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,各位 保重了 再见
Dialogue: 0,1:35:29.41,1:35:32.50,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,按下来要帮助发条都市恢复原状
Dialogue: 0,1:35:32.91,1:35:37.83,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大雄 这个星球就交给皮姆它们\N这样比较好
Dialogue: 0,1:35:38.33,1:35:41.16,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们偶尔来找你们玩
Dialogue: 0,1:35:41.50,1:35:42.66,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,嗯...好啊
Dialogue: 0,1:35:44.50,1:35:48.16,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,皮姆 波比 你们要加油哦\N我们会常来找你们玩
Dialogue: 0,1:35:48.54,1:35:50.20,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,宜静小姐 保重了
Dialogue: 0,1:35:50.70,1:35:53.16,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,恐龙老弟 哥哥会在遥远的地球上
Dialogue: 0,1:35:53.87,1:35:56.04,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,祈求你永远幸福
Dialogue: 0,1:35:56.66,1:35:58.50,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,技安 你未免太夸张了
Dialogue: 0,1:35:59.25,1:36:01.00,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,小木马 好好保重
Dialogue: 0,1:36:01.37,1:36:02.50,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,再见了
Dialogue: 0,1:36:02.83,1:36:03.70,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们会再来的
Dialogue: 0,1:36:03.87,1:36:04.87,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,再见
Dialogue: 0,1:36:05.20,1:36:06.50,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们会再来找你们的
Dialogue: 0,1:36:08.20,1:36:10.20,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大家保重了
Dialogue: 0,1:36:14.10,1:36:22.30,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,只要有爱就够了\N爱だけあればいい
Dialogue: 0,1:36:23.10,1:36:32.00,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,一切都是 为你\Nすべては　For you
Dialogue: 0,1:36:33.00,1:36:41.10,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,荡漾在心中的思念\Nれるこの想い
Dialogue: 0,1:36:42.00,1:36:48.14,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,无法抑止的爱\Nたまらなく　いとしくて
Dialogue: 0,1:36:51.34,1:36:57.52,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,啦啦啦... 爱就是你\NLaLaLa... Love is you
Dialogue: 0,1:37:00.61,1:37:13.07,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,街上的风　也回应着我\N街は风の中　答えも
Dialogue: 0,1:37:13.75,1:37:16.07,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,在那风中\NIn the wind
Dialogue: 0,1:37:18.87,1:37:26.50,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,即使再沉重的悲哀\Nどんな悲しみも
Dialogue: 0,1:37:27.87,1:37:36.20,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我也要关上心扉挡住\Nくい止めよう　心の手前で
Dialogue: 0,1:37:37.30,1:37:43.31,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,在这泪水与笑容\Nと微笑みを
Dialogue: 0,1:37:46.50,1:37:55.71,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,一再上演的都市中\N缲り返すこの都?（まち）
Dialogue: 0,1:37:55.71,1:38:03.07,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,全都忘掉吧　就在此刻\Nすべてを忘れて　今は
Dialogue: 0,1:38:04.77,1:38:08.05,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,现在的我只想紧紧抱住你\N抱きしめたい
Dialogue: 0,1:38:09.37,1:38:11.35,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,爱就是你\NLove is you
Dialogue: 0,1:38:14.00,1:38:20.31,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,在这泪水与笑容\Nと微笑みを
Dialogue: 0,1:38:23.00,1:38:29.51,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,一再上演的都市中\N缲り返すこの都?（まち）
